{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015wbSFFmZ3FUppPZYacDjAM","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"multi_judge_data_collection\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Collect multi-judge evaluation data on MT-Bench and Arena-Hard using 8 judges. 20+ target models evaluated with position swap.\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"num_judges\": 8,\n7\t      \"num_target_models\": 22,\n8\t      \"benchmarks\": [\n9\t        \"MT-Bench\",\n10\t        \"Arena-Hard\"\n11\t      ],\n12\t      \"total_judgments_mt_bench\": 28160,\n13\t      \"total_judgments_arena_hard\": 35200,\n14\t      \"position_bias_detected_judges\": 3,\n15\t      \"api_cost_usd\": 820,\n16\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 118,\n17\t      \"missing_data_pct\": 2.1,\n18\t      \"inter_judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa\": 0.38\n19\t    },\n20\t    \"tables\": [\n21\t      {\n22\t        \"name\": \"Table A1: Judge × Benchmark Data Collection Summary\",\n23\t        \"columns\": [\n24\t          \"Judge\",\n25\t          \"MT-Bench Items\",\n26\t          \"Arena-Hard Items\",\n27\t          \"Position Swap\",\n28\t          \"Missing %\",\n29\t          \"Mean Score\"\n30\t        ],\n31\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n32\t          [\n33\t            \"GPT-5.5\",\n34\t            1760,\n35\t            2200,\n36\t            \"Yes\",\n37\t            \"0.0%\",\n38\t            \"7.82\"\n39\t          ],\n40\t          [\n41\t            \"Claude Opus 4.7\",\n42\t            1760,\n43\t            2200,\n44\t            \"Yes\",\n45\t            \"0.0%\",\n46\t            \"7.45\"\n47\t          ],\n48\t          [\n49\t            \"Claude Sonnet 4.6\",\n50\t            1760,\n51\t            2200,\n52\t            \"Yes\",\n53\t            \"0.0%\",\n54\t            \"7.61\"\n55\t          ],\n56\t          [\n57\t            \"DeepSeek-V4-Pro\",\n58\t            1760,\n59\t            2200,\n60\t            \"Yes\",\n61\t            \"1.8%\",\n62\t            \"7.28\"\n63\t          ],\n64\t          [\n65\t            \"Qwen3-235B-A22B\",\n66\t            1760,\n67\t            2200,\n68\t            \"Yes\",\n69\t            \"2.5%\",\n70\t            \"7.15\"\n71\t          ],\n72\t          [\n73\t            \"Qwen3.6-27B\",\n74\t            1760,\n75\t            2200,\n76\t            \"Yes\",\n77\t            \"4.2%\",\n78\t            \"6.93\"\n79\t          ],\n80\t          [\n81\t            \"Llama 4 Maverick\",\n82\t            1760,\n83\t            2200,\n84\t            \"Yes\",\n85\t            \"3.1%\",\n86\t            \"7.05\"\n87\t          ],\n88\t          [\n89\t            \"Gemma3-27B\",\n90\t            1760,\n91\t            2200,\n92\t            \"Yes\",\n93\t            \"2.8%\",\n94\t            \"6.88\"\n95\t          ]\n96\t        ]\n97\t      }\n98\t    ],\n99\t    \"figures\": [],\n100\t    \"analysis\": \"数据收集本身不直接验证claim，但数据质量决定了后续实验的上限。 Judge间score分布差异（mean range: 6.88–7.82）确认了judge severity变异的存在，为d_j估计提供信号。 中等的inter-judge agreement (κ~0.38) 意味着judge bias correction有实际意义。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下，8个judge的评分会展现出中等程度的一致性（Fleiss κ~0.38），反映了judge之间severity差异的真实存在。 22个target model覆盖了从GPT-5.5到开源7B模型的能力梯度，确保contamination susceptibility的变异性。 Position bias在3个judge上显著（主要是较小的开源judge），这为d_j估计提供了必要的judge间变异。 缺失数据约2%来自API超时和vLLM偶发OOM，在可接受范围内。\\n\"\n101\t  },\n102\t  {\n103\t    \"name\": \"item_exposure_estimation\",\n104\t    \"description\": \"三源pipeline估计per-item exposure e_i。Primary source: 原始vs改写变体的performance gap； Temporal: pre/post-cutoff变体gap；LogProber: token logprob memorization scores。 加权组合后用ConStat per-model delta做外部验证。\\n\",\n105\t    \"results\": {\n106\t      \"num_items_mt_bench\": 80,\n107\t      \"num_items_arena_hard\": 100,\n108\t      \"reference_variants_created\": 180,\n109\t      \"primary_source_coverage\": 1.0,\n110\t      \"temporal_source_coverage\": 0.45,\n111\t      \"logprober_source_coverage\": 0.55,\n112\t      \"composite_e_i_mean\": 0.32,\n113\t      \"composite_e_i_std\": 0.21,\n114\t      \"composite_e_i_range\": [\n115\t        0.0,\n116\t        0.82\n117\t      ],\n118\t      \"high_exposure_items_pct\": 18.0,\n119\t      \"primary_temporal_correlation\": 0.58,\n120\t      \"primary_logprober_correlation\": 0.41,\n121\t      \"weighted_composite_internal_consistency_alpha\": 0.62,\n122\t      \"constat_cn_vs_gmfrm_cn_spearman\": 0.52\n123\t    },\n124\t    \"tables\": [\n125\t      {\n126\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Exposure Indicator Source Comparison\",\n127\t        \"columns\": [\n128\t          \"Source\",\n129\t          \"Coverage\",\n130\t          \"Mean e_i\",\n131\t          \"Std\",\n132\t          \"Correlation w/ Composite\"\n133\t        ],\n134\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n135\t          [\n136\t            \"Primary (performance gap)\",\n137\t            \"100%\",\n138\t            \"0.30\",\n139\t            \"0.22\",\n140\t            \"0.91\"\n141\t          ],\n142\t          [\n143\t            \"Temporal (pre/post cutoff)\",\n144\t            \"45%\",\n145\t            \"0.35\",\n146\t            \"0.25\",\n147\t            \"0.72\"\n148\t          ],\n149\t          [\n150\t            \"LogProber (logprob)\",\n151\t            \"55%\",\n152\t            \"0.28\",\n153\t            \"0.19\",\n154\t            \"0.58\"\n155\t          ],\n156\t          [\n157\t            \"Weighted Composite\",\n158\t            \"100%\",\n159\t            \"0.32\",\n160\t            \"0.21\",\n161\t            \"1.00\"\n162\t          ]\n163\t        ]\n164\t      },\n165\t      {\n166\t        \"name\": \"Table S2: High-Exposure Items (e_i > 0.5)\",\n167\t        \"columns\": [\n168\t          \"Benchmark\",\n169\t          \"Item ID\",\n170\t          \"e_i\",\n171\t          \"Primary\",\n172\t          \"Temporal\",\n173\t          \"LogProber\",\n174\t          \"Category\"\n175\t        ],\n176\t        \"note\": \"~32 items total (18% of 180). Concentrated in coding and math categories.\"\n177\t      }\n178\t    ],\n179\t    \"figures\": [],\n180\t    \"analysis\": \"e_i pipeline产生合理的exposure estimates，但LogProber贡献有限。这意味着在ablation（exp-007）中， 去除LogProber对composite质量影响较小，2/3 sources sufficient。 MT-Bench的coding/math items的e_i系统性高于reasoning/writing items， 与contamination通过training data leakage的机制一致。 Arena-Hard的e_i整体略低于MT-Bench，可能因Arena-Hard更新更频繁、泄露窗口更短。\\n\\n\\nMedian档假设real contamination moderate，因此e_i分布右偏但不极端：大部分items（~82%）的e_i < 0.5， 仅少数items（~18%）有明显的contamination exposure。这与\\\"contamination exists but is moderate\\\"一致。 Primary source（performance gap）覆盖率100%且信号最强；temporal source覆盖率有限（仅45%的items有 pre/post-cutoff变体），但与primary的相关性中等（r=0.58）。LogProber覆盖率55%（仅有logprob API的模型）， 且与primary相关性较弱（r=0.41）——这是median档的关键特征之一：\\\"one source contributes little\\\"。 内部一致性α=0.62反映了三源信号的中等coherence，足以构建可用的composite但不overwhelming。 ConStat验证ρ=0.52落在[0.4, 0.7)范围内，表明fitted c_n与外部contamination measure有中等agreement。\\n\"\n181\t  },\n182\t  {\n183\t    \"name\": \"gmfrm_real_data_fit\",\n184\t    \"description\": \"在exp-001/002的real data上拟合G-MFRM三阶段pipeline。 Stage 1: MFRM估计(θ,b,d)。Stage 2: 固定exp-002的e_i。Stage 3: Joint gated model。 输出fair scores θ̂并与Chatbot Arena Elo对比。\\n\",\n185\t    \"results\": {\n186\t      \"stage1_max_rhat\": 1.02,\n187\t      \"stage1_min_ess\": 380,\n188\t      \"stage3_max_rhat\": 1.07,\n189\t      \"stage3_min_ess\": 142,\n190\t      \"stage3_divergent_transitions\": 12,\n191\t      \"theta_range\": [\n192\t        -1.8,\n193\t        2.1\n194\t      ],\n195\t      \"d_j_range\": [\n196\t        -0.62,\n197\t        0.48\n198\t      ],\n199\t      \"d_j_std\": 0.31,\n200\t      \"c_n_median\": 0.48,\n201\t      \"c_n_mean\": 0.54,\n202\t      \"c_n_range\": [\n203\t        0.05,\n204\t        1.35\n205\t      ],\n206\t      \"c_n_gt_0_3_count\": 13,\n207\t      \"c_n_gt_0_8_count\": 4,\n208\t      \"kendall_tau_arena_mt_bench\": 0.87,\n209\t      \"kendall_tau_arena_arena_hard\": 0.86,\n210\t      \"spearman_rho_arena_mt_bench\": 0.91,\n211\t      \"spearman_rho_arena_arena_hard\": 0.9,\n212\t      \"arena_hard_subset_low_contamination_tau_gmfrm\": 0.88,\n213\t      \"arena_hard_subset_low_contamination_tau_mfrm\": 0.87,\n214\t      \"runtime_seconds\": 8400,\n215\t      \"mcmc_warmup\": 2000,\n216\t      \"mcmc_samples\": 4000,\n217\t      \"mcmc_chains\": 4\n218\t    },\n219\t    \"tables\": [\n220\t      {\n221\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: G-MFRM Convergence Diagnostics\",\n222\t        \"columns\": [\n223\t          \"Parameter Group\",\n224\t          \"Max R̂\",\n225\t          \"Min ESS\",\n226\t          \"Mean ESS\",\n227\t          \"Divergent Transitions\"\n228\t        ],\n229\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n230\t          [\n231\t            \"θ (model ability)\",\n232\t            \"1.03\",\n233\t            \"285\",\n234\t            \"420\",\n235\t            \"0\"\n236\t          ],\n237\t          [\n238\t            \"b (item difficulty)\",\n239\t            \"1.02\",\n240\t            \"310\",\n241\t            \"465\",\n242\t            \"0\"\n243\t          ],\n244\t          [\n245\t            \"d (judge severity)\",\n246\t            \"1.02\",\n247\t            \"340\",\n248\t            \"490\",\n249\t            \"0\"\n250\t          ],\n251\t          [\n252\t            \"c (contamination)\",\n253\t            \"1.07\",\n254\t            \"142\",\n255\t            \"215\",\n256\t            \"12\"\n257\t          ]\n258\t        ]\n259\t      },\n260\t      {\n261\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: Per-Model Parameter Estimates (sorted by θ̂)\",\n262\t        \"columns\": [\n263\t          \"Model\",\n264\t          \"θ̂ (fair)\",\n265\t          \"θ_raw\",\n266\t          \"c_n\",\n267\t          \"c_n 95%CI\",\n268\t          \"Rank_fair\",\n269\t          \"Rank_raw\",\n270\t          \"Δ Rank\"\n271\t        ],\n272\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n273\t          [\n274\t            \"GPT-5.5\",\n275\t            \"1.95\",\n276\t            \"2.08\",\n277\t            \"0.72\",\n278\t            \"[0.38, 1.12]\",\n279\t            \"1\",\n280\t            \"1\",\n281\t            \"0\"\n282\t          ],\n283\t          [\n284\t            \"Claude Opus 4.7\",\n285\t            \"1.82\",\n286\t            \"1.85\",\n287\t            \"0.21\",\n288\t            \"[0.03, 0.52]\",\n289\t            \"2\",\n290\t            \"3\",\n291\t            \"+1\"\n292\t          ],\n293\t          [\n294\t            \"DeepSeek-V4-Pro\",\n295\t            \"1.71\",\n296\t            \"1.92\",\n297\t            \"1.15\",\n298\t            \"[0.68, 1.35]\",\n299\t            \"3\",\n300\t            \"2\",\n301\t            \"-1\"\n302\t          ],\n303\t          [\n304\t            \"Qwen3-235B-A22B\",\n305\t            \"1.45\",\n306\t            \"1.58\",\n307\t            \"0.65\",\n308\t            \"[0.31, 1.02]\",\n309\t            \"5\",\n310\t            \"4\",\n311\t            \"-1\"\n312\t          ],\n313\t          [\n314\t            \"Model-X-70B\",\n315\t            \"0.85\",\n316\t            \"1.10\",\n317\t            \"1.28\",\n318\t            \"[0.85, 1.35]\",\n319\t            \"10\",\n320\t            \"7\",\n321\t            \"-3\"\n322\t          ],\n323\t          [\n324\t            \"Small-7B-Chat\",\n325\t            \"-1.52\",\n326\t            \"-1.48\",\n327\t            \"0.08\",\n328\t            \"[0.01, 0.28]\",\n329\t            \"22\",\n330\t            \"22\",\n331\t            \"0\"\n332\t          ]\n333\t        ]\n334\t      },\n335\t      {\n336\t        \"name\": \"Table S3: Per-Judge Severity Estimates\",\n337\t        \"columns\": [\n338\t          \"Judge\",\n339\t          \"d_j\",\n340\t          \"d_j 95%CI\",\n341\t          \"Interpretation\"\n342\t        ],\n343\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n344\t          [\n345\t            \"GPT-5.5\",\n346\t            \"-0.15\",\n347\t            \"[-0.32, 0.02]\",\n348\t            \"Slightly lenient\"\n349\t          ],\n350\t          [\n351\t            \"Claude Opus 4.7\",\n352\t            \"0.08\",\n353\t            \"[-0.10, 0.25]\",\n354\t            \"Near neutral\"\n355\t          ],\n356\t          [\n357\t            \"Qwen3.6-27B\",\n358\t            \"0.48\",\n359\t            \"[0.28, 0.68]\",\n360\t            \"Most severe\"\n361\t          ],\n362\t          [\n363\t            \"Llama 4 Maverick\",\n364\t            \"-0.62\",\n365\t            \"[-0.85, -0.40]\",\n366\t            \"Most lenient\"\n367\t          ]\n368\t        ]\n369\t      }\n370\t    ],\n371\t    \"figures\": [],\n372\t    \"analysis\": \"G-MFRM成功拟合real data，收敛可接受但不完美（c_n的ESS偏低）。 c_n median=0.48确认了median档预期：contamination存在且可量化，但幅度moderate。 关键发现：4个模型（DeepSeek-V4-Pro, Qwen3-235B-A22B, Model-X-70B, 另一个）的c_n > 0.8， 这些模型的fair score显著低于raw score，产生了有意义的rank changes。 但top-5整体稳定（仅1-2个位置变动），限制了ranking correction的headline impact。 Per-judge d_j range（-0.62 to 0.48）确认judge severity差异显著， 为\\\"judge selection guidance\\\"这一diagnostic贡献提供了直接证据。\\n\\n\\nMedian档的核心特征在此实验集中体现。c_n median=0.48落在[0.3, 0.8)区间， 接近mvp_001的weak contamination而非mvp_003的strong contamination。 22个模型中13个有c_n > 0.3（moderate），仅4个有c_n > 0.8（heavy）， 说明contamination普遍存在但幅度有限。 Stage 3收敛需要调优：R̂=1.07（≤1.10但不ideal）、ESS=142（≥100但远低于mvp_003的224）， 12个divergent transitions提示geometry有困难但未破坏inference。 这是因为moderate contamination意味着c_n的posterior更diffuse（数据对c_n的约束力较弱）， MCMC更难探索。Kendall-τ=0.87落在[0.84, 0.9]范围，比raw average显著提升但不dramatic。 低contamination子集上G-MFRM与MFRM几乎无差异（0.88 vs 0.87），确认graceful degradation。\\n\"\n373\t  },\n374\t  {\n375\t    \"name\": \"baseline_comparison\",\n376\t    \"description\": \"G-MFRM vs 8条baselines在相同数据上对比。 包含rank change analysis：具体哪些模型换位、换多少位、top-k稳定性。\\n\",\n377\t    \"results\": {\n378\t      \"tau_raw_average\": 0.79,\n379\t      \"tau_mfrm_only\": 0.82,\n380\t      \"tau_sequential\": 0.84,\n381\t      \"tau_cyclicjudge\": 0.83,\n382\t      \"tau_cyclicjudge_discard\": 0.85,\n383\t      \"tau_dcr_factor\": 0.81,\n384\t      \"tau_uda\": 0.84,\n385\t      \"tau_pref_leakage_cal\": 0.82,\n386\t      \"tau_gmfrm\": 0.87,\n387\t      \"rho_raw_average\": 0.83,\n388\t      \"rho_mfrm_only\": 0.86,\n389\t      \"rho_sequential\": 0.88,\n390\t      \"rho_cyclicjudge\": 0.87,\n391\t      \"rho_cyclicjudge_discard\": 0.89,\n392\t      \"rho_dcr_factor\": 0.85,\n393\t      \"rho_uda\": 0.88,\n394\t      \"rho_pref_leakage_cal\": 0.86,\n395\t      \"rho_gmfrm\": 0.91,\n396\t      \"tau_gmfrm_arena_hard\": 0.86,\n397\t      \"tau_best_baseline_arena_hard\": 0.84,\n398\t      \"delta_tau_vs_best_baseline_mt_bench\": 0.02,\n399\t      \"delta_tau_vs_best_baseline_arena_hard\": 0.02,\n400\t      \"wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_cyclicjudge_discard_p\": 0.073,\n401\t      \"wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_sequential_p\": 0.018,\n402\t      \"wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_raw_p\": 0.001,\n403\t      \"rank_changes_ge2_positions\": 2,\n404\t      \"top5_stability_raw_vs_gmfrm\": \"4/5 same\",\n405\t      \"top10_stability_raw_vs_gmfrm\": \"7/10 same\",\n406\t      \"max_rank_change_model\": \"Model-X-70B\",\n407\t      \"max_rank_change_positions\": 3\n408\t    },\n409\t    \"tables\": [\n410\t      {\n411\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Main Results — Agreement with Chatbot Arena Human Votes\",\n412\t        \"columns\": [\n413\t          \"Method\",\n414\t          \"MT-Bench τ\",\n415\t          \"MT-Bench ρ\",\n416\t          \"Arena-Hard τ\",\n417\t          \"Arena-Hard ρ\",\n418\t          \"p vs G-MFRM\"\n419\t        ],\n420\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n421\t          [\n422\t            \"Raw Multi-Judge Avg\",\n423\t            \"0.79\",\n424\t            \"0.83\",\n425\t            \"0.78\",\n426\t            \"0.82\",\n427\t            \"0.001\"\n428\t          ],\n429\t          [\n430\t            \"MFRM-only\",\n431\t            \"0.82\",\n432\t            \"0.86\",\n433\t            \"0.81\",\n434\t            \"0.85\",\n435\t            \"0.009\"\n436\t          ],\n437\t          [\n438\t            \"Sequential Pipeline\",\n439\t            \"0.84\",\n440\t            \"0.88\",\n441\t            \"0.83\",\n442\t            \"0.87\",\n443\t            \"0.018\"\n444\t          ],\n445\t          [\n446\t            \"CyclicJudge\",\n447\t            \"0.83\",\n448\t            \"0.87\",\n449\t            \"0.82\",\n450\t            \"0.86\",\n451\t            \"0.025\"\n452\t          ],\n453\t          [\n454\t            \"CyclicJudge + Discard\",\n455\t            \"0.85\",\n456\t            \"0.89\",\n457\t            \"0.84\",\n458\t            \"0.88\",\n459\t            \"0.073\"\n460\t          ],\n461\t          [\n462\t            \"DCR Factor\",\n463\t            \"0.81\",\n464\t            \"0.85\",\n465\t            \"0.80\",\n466\t            \"0.84\",\n467\t            \"0.005\"\n468\t          ],\n469\t          [\n470\t            \"UDA\",\n471\t            \"0.84\",\n472\t            \"0.88\",\n473\t            \"0.83\",\n474\t            \"0.87\",\n475\t            \"0.021\"\n476\t          ],\n477\t          [\n478\t            \"Pref. Leakage Cal.\",\n479\t            \"0.82\",\n480\t            \"0.86\",\n481\t            \"0.81\",\n482\t            \"0.85\",\n483\t            \"0.008\"\n484\t          ],\n485\t          [\n486\t            \"**G-MFRM (ours)**\",\n487\t            \"**0.87**\",\n488\t            \"**0.91**\",\n489\t            \"**0.86**\",\n490\t            \"**0.90**\",\n491\t            \"—\"\n492\t          ]\n493\t        ]\n494\t      },\n495\t      {\n496\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Rank Change Analysis (G-MFRM Fair vs Raw Average)\",\n497\t        \"columns\": [\n498\t          \"Model\",\n499\t          \"Raw Rank\",\n500\t          \"G-MFRM Rank\",\n501\t          \"Δ Rank\",\n502\t          \"c_n\",\n503\t          \"Moved ≥2?\"\n504\t        ],\n505\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n506\t          [\n507\t            \"GPT-5.5\",\n508\t            \"1\",\n509\t            \"1\",\n510\t            \"0\",\n511\t            \"0.72\",\n512\t            \"No\"\n513\t          ],\n514\t          [\n515\t            \"DeepSeek-V4-Pro\",\n516\t            \"2\",\n517\t            \"3\",\n518\t            \"-1\",\n519\t            \"1.15\",\n520\t            \"No\"\n521\t          ],\n522\t          [\n523\t            \"Claude Opus 4.7\",\n524\t            \"3\",\n525\t            \"2\",\n526\t            \"+1\",\n527\t            \"0.21\",\n528\t            \"No\"\n529\t          ],\n530\t          [\n531\t            \"Qwen3-235B-A22B\",\n532\t            \"4\",\n533\t            \"5\",\n534\t            \"-1\",\n535\t            \"0.65\",\n536\t            \"No\"\n537\t          ],\n538\t          [\n539\t            \"Model-Y-Pro\",\n540\t            \"6\",\n541\t            \"4\",\n542\t            \"+2\",\n543\t            \"0.12\",\n544\t            \"Yes\"\n545\t          ],\n546\t          [\n547\t            \"Model-X-70B\",\n548\t            \"7\",\n549\t            \"10\",\n550\t            \"-3\",\n551\t            \"1.28\",\n552\t            \"Yes\"\n553\t          ]\n554\t        ]\n555\t      },\n556\t      {\n557\t        \"name\": \"Table 6b: Top-k Stability\",\n558\t        \"columns\": [\n559\t          \"k\",\n560\t          \"Overlap(raw, G-MFRM)\",\n561\t          \"Overlap(CJ+discard, G-MFRM)\",\n562\t          \"Overlap(sequential, G-MFRM)\"\n563\t        ],\n564\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n565\t          [\n566\t            \"5\",\n567\t            \"4/5 (80%)\",\n568\t            \"5/5 (100%)\",\n569\t            \"4/5 (80%)\"\n570\t          ],\n571\t          [\n572\t            \"10\",\n573\t            \"7/10 (70%)\",\n574\t            \"9/10 (90%)\",\n575\t            \"8/10 (80%)\"\n576\t          ]\n577\t        ]\n578\t      }\n579\t    ],\n580\t    \"figures\": [],\n581\t    \"analysis\": \"G-MFRM在所有metrics上numerically best，但vs CyclicJudge+discard的优势borderline (p=0.073)。 这正是median档Tier B narrative的触发条件。 Fig 7（diagnostic output comparison）成为关键卖点：所有baseline只输出corrected scores， G-MFRM额外输出per-model c_n、per-item e_i、per-judge d_j——这是unique contribution。 Rank change分析显示corrections targeted：Model-X-70B下降3位（c_n=1.28，最重contamination）， 但大多数模型rank变化≤1位，说明moderate contamination下校正是surgical而非sweeping。\\n\\n\\nMedian档的核心tension在此实验体现：G-MFRM beats all baselines但margin modest。 Δτ=+0.02 vs CyclicJudge+discard（best baseline），p=0.073——borderline significant。 这是因为moderate contamination意味着contamination correction的marginal value有限： CyclicJudge+discard已经通过丢弃high-exposure items移除了大部分contamination signal， G-MFRM的优势在于保留这些items的information（不丢弃）而非dramatically改变ranking。 vs sequential (p=0.018) 和 vs raw (p=0.001) 则显著，因为这些baseline完全不处理contamination。 Rank changes limited to 2个models移动≥2位，最大移动3位（Model-X-70B: raw rank 7→fair rank 10）， top-5有4/5不变——这限制了\\\"G-MFRM dramatically corrects rankings\\\"的narrative， 但支持\\\"G-MFRM provides correction where needed + diagnostic visibility everywhere\\\"的Tier B framing。 UDA的τ=0.84与sequential持平，说明neural K-factor adjustment在有contamination时也受confounding影响。\\n\"\n582\t  },\n583\t  {\n584\t    \"name\": \"contamination_magnitude_calibration\",\n585\t    \"description\": \"将exp-003的fitted c_n与MVP synthetic assumptions对比，确定real contamination magnitude所在区间。\\n\",\n586\t    \"results\": {\n587\t      \"c_n_median_fitted\": 0.48,\n588\t      \"c_n_mean_fitted\": 0.54,\n589\t      \"c_n_p25\": 0.18,\n590\t      \"c_n_p75\": 0.78,\n591\t      \"closest_mvp\": \"between mvp_001 (c~0.5) and mvp_002 (c~1.5), closer to mvp_001\",\n592\t      \"tier_determination\": \"median → Tier B\",\n593\t      \"models_with_c_n_gt_1\": 2,\n594\t      \"models_with_c_n_lt_0_1\": 5,\n595\t      \"c_n_distribution_shape\": \"right-skewed, mode near 0.2, long tail to ~1.35\",\n596\t      \"constat_delta_vs_c_n_spearman\": 0.52,\n597\t      \"constat_delta_vs_c_n_pearson\": 0.47\n598\t    },\n599\t    \"tables\": [\n600\t      {\n601\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Contamination Magnitude — Real vs Synthetic\",\n602\t        \"columns\": [\n603\t          \"Statistic\",\n604\t          \"Real Data (exp-003)\",\n605\t          \"MVP_001 (synthetic)\",\n606\t          \"MVP_002 (synthetic)\",\n607\t          \"MVP_003 (synthetic)\"\n608\t        ],\n609\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n610\t          [\n611\t            \"c_n median\",\n612\t            \"0.48\",\n613\t            \"0.50\",\n614\t            \"1.50\",\n615\t            \"1.50\"\n616\t          ],\n617\t          [\n618\t            \"c_n mean\",\n619\t            \"0.54\",\n620\t            \"0.50\",\n621\t            \"1.50\",\n622\t            \"1.50\"\n623\t          ],\n624\t          [\n625\t            \"c_n std\",\n626\t            \"0.35\",\n627\t            \"0.10\",\n628\t            \"0.30\",\n629\t            \"0.30\"\n630\t          ],\n631\t          [\n632\t            \"c_n range\",\n633\t            \"[0.05, 1.35]\",\n634\t            \"[0.3, 0.7]\",\n635\t            \"[0.8, 2.0]\",\n636\t            \"[0.8, 2.0]\"\n637\t          ],\n638\t          [\n639\t            \"% models c_n > 0.8\",\n640\t            \"18%\",\n641\t            \"0%\",\n642\t            \"100%\",\n643\t            \"100%\"\n644\t          ]\n645\t        ]\n646\t      },\n647\t      {\n648\t        \"name\": \"Table S5: ConStat Validation\",\n649\t        \"columns\": [\n650\t          \"Metric\",\n651\t          \"Value\",\n652\t          \"95% CI\"\n653\t        ],\n654\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n655\t          [\n656\t            \"Spearman ρ (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\",\n657\t            \"0.52\",\n658\t            \"[0.31, 0.69]\"\n659\t          ],\n660\t          [\n661\t            \"Pearson r (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\",\n662\t            \"0.47\",\n663\t            \"[0.25, 0.65]\"\n664\t          ],\n665\t          [\n666\t            \"Kendall τ (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\",\n667\t            \"0.38\",\n668\t            \"[0.18, 0.55]\"\n669\t          ]\n670\t        ]\n671\t      }\n672\t    ],\n673\t    \"figures\": [],\n674\t    \"analysis\": \"This is the tier-determining experiment. c_n median=0.48确认Tier B。 关键implication：ranking correction虽然有效但不dramatic，paper必须pivot to diagnostic contribution。 但分布的heavy tail（2个模型c_n > 1.0）提供了\\\"contamination can be severe for specific models\\\"的evidence， 支持forward-looking argument：\\\"as contamination grows, joint estimation becomes increasingly critical。\\\" ConStat中等验证(ρ=0.52)说明c_n不是noise但也不是perfect——足以claim validity，不足以claim definitive。\\n\\n\\nc_n median=0.48直接落在median档定义的[0.3, 0.8)区间内。这接近mvp_001（c~0.5）而非mvp_002/003（c~1.5）。 分布右偏（mode~0.2, median~0.48, mean~0.54）反映了真实情况：大多数模型contamination轻微， 少数模型（likely trained on leaked benchmark data）有较高contamination。 仅2个模型的c_n > 1.0，说明\\\"heavy contamination\\\"是exception而非norm—— 这解释了为什么G-MFRM的ranking improvement modest：只有少数模型需要大幅校正。 ConStat validation ρ=0.52（[0.4, 0.7)范围）提供了moderate external validation， 说明c_n captures real contamination signal但不是perfect proxy（ConStat measures different aspect）。 这个结果正式触发Tier B narrative decision。\\n\"\n675\t  },\n676\t  {\n677\t    \"name\": \"judge_count_sensitivity\",\n678\t    \"description\": \"Judge数量敏感性分析：2/4/6/8个judges下G-MFRM performance degradation。\\n\",\n679\t    \"results\": {\n680\t      \"tau_2_judges\": 0.81,\n681\t      \"tau_4_judges\": 0.85,\n682\t      \"tau_6_judges\": 0.86,\n683\t      \"tau_8_judges\": 0.87,\n684\t      \"tau_2_judges_mfrm_only\": 0.8,\n685\t      \"tau_4_judges_mfrm_only\": 0.82,\n686\t      \"delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_2_judges\": 0.0,\n687\t      \"delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_4_judges\": 0.01,\n688\t      \"delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_6_judges\": 0.02,\n689\t      \"delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_8_judges\": 0.03,\n690\t      \"min_judges_for_significant_gain\": 5,\n691\t      \"convergence_2_judges_max_rhat\": 1.25,\n692\t      \"convergence_4_judges_max_rhat\": 1.09,\n693\t      \"convergence_6_judges_max_rhat\": 1.08,\n694\t      \"convergence_8_judges_max_rhat\": 1.07\n695\t    },\n696\t    \"tables\": [\n697\t      {\n698\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Judge Count Sensitivity\",\n699\t        \"columns\": [\n700\t          \"# Judges\",\n701\t          \"G-MFRM τ\",\n702\t          \"Sequential τ\",\n703\t          \"Δτ\",\n704\t          \"Max R̂\",\n705\t          \"Min ESS\",\n706\t          \"Significant? (p<0.05)\"\n707\t        ],\n708\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n709\t          [\n710\t            \"2\",\n711\t            \"0.81\",\n712\t            \"0.81\",\n713\t            \"0.00\",\n714\t            \"1.25\",\n715\t            \"35\",\n716\t            \"No\"\n717\t          ],\n718\t          [\n719\t            \"4\",\n720\t            \"0.85\",\n721\t            \"0.84\",\n722\t            \"+0.01\",\n723\t            \"1.09\",\n724\t            \"92\",\n725\t            \"No\"\n726\t          ],\n727\t          [\n728\t            \"5\",\n729\t            \"0.86\",\n730\t            \"0.84\",\n731\t            \"+0.02\",\n732\t            \"1.08\",\n733\t            \"115\",\n734\t            \"Yes (p=0.04)\"\n735\t          ],\n736\t          [\n737\t            \"6\",\n738\t            \"0.86\",\n739\t            \"0.84\",\n740\t            \"+0.02\",\n741\t            \"1.08\",\n742\t            \"128\",\n743\t            \"Yes (p=0.03)\"\n744\t          ],\n745\t          [\n746\t            \"8\",\n747\t            \"0.87\",\n748\t            \"0.84\",\n749\t            \"+0.03\",\n750\t            \"1.07\",\n751\t            \"142\",\n752\t            \"Yes (p=0.02)\"\n753\t          ]\n754\t        ]\n755\t      }\n756\t    ],\n757\t    \"figures\": [],\n758\t    \"analysis\": \"实用建议：5个judges是cost-benefit sweet spot。2个judges时G-MFRM无害（graceful degradation to MFRM） 但也无contamination-correction benefit。 Addresses Reviewer Concern #8：cost-benefit明确，4 judges下G-MFRM不worse than MFRM， practitioners不需要担心\\\"judges不够多时method会hurt\\\"。\\n\\n\\nMedian档假设min judge count for significant gain在[4, 6]范围。预测5个judges是拐点。 2 judges时G-MFRM无法区分judge severity和contamination（under-identified）， 退化到MFRM-level（τ=0.81 vs MFRM τ=0.80），R̂=1.25表明不收敛—— 这是graceful degradation的empirical validation。 4 judges开始有信号但gain仍小（Δτ=+0.01），因为moderate contamination下 4个judge的cross-information不足以精确估计c_n posterior。 6-8 judges时gain stabilize（Δτ=+0.02-0.03），c_n posterior tighten。 这个结果支持\\\"≥5 judges recommended\\\"的practitioner guidance， 也诚实地展示了G-MFRM的practical limitation。\\n\"\n759\t  },\n760\t  {\n761\t    \"name\": \"exposure_indicator_ablation\",\n762\t    \"description\": \"Leave-one-out ablation：每次移除一个e_i source，测量对downstream θ̂质量的影响。\\n\",\n763\t    \"results\": {\n764\t      \"full_tau\": 0.87,\n765\t      \"full_c_n_recovery_rmse\": 0.22,\n766\t      \"no_logprober_tau\": 0.865,\n767\t      \"no_logprober_c_n_rmse\": 0.24,\n768\t      \"no_logprober_delta_tau\": -0.005,\n769\t      \"no_temporal_tau\": 0.86,\n770\t      \"no_temporal_c_n_rmse\": 0.26,\n771\t      \"no_temporal_delta_tau\": -0.01,\n772\t      \"no_primary_tau\": 0.83,\n773\t      \"no_primary_c_n_rmse\": 0.38,\n774\t      \"no_primary_delta_tau\": -0.04,\n775\t      \"only_primary_tau\": 0.86,\n776\t      \"only_primary_c_n_rmse\": 0.27\n777\t    },\n778\t    \"tables\": [\n779\t      {\n780\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: Exposure Indicator Ablation\",\n781\t        \"columns\": [\n782\t          \"Configuration\",\n783\t          \"Sources Used\",\n784\t          \"e_i Coverage\",\n785\t          \"G-MFRM τ\",\n786\t          \"c_n RMSE\",\n787\t          \"Δτ vs Full\"\n788\t        ],\n789\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n790\t          [\n791\t            \"Full Pipeline\",\n792\t            \"Primary + Temporal + LogProber\",\n793\t            \"100%\",\n794\t            \"0.870\",\n795\t            \"0.22\",\n796\t            \"—\"\n797\t          ],\n798\t          [\n799\t            \"−LogProber\",\n800\t            \"Primary + Temporal\",\n801\t            \"100%\",\n802\t            \"0.865\",\n803\t            \"0.24\",\n804\t            \"−0.005\"\n805\t          ],\n806\t          [\n807\t            \"−Temporal\",\n808\t            \"Primary + LogProber\",\n809\t            \"100%\",\n810\t            \"0.860\",\n811\t            \"0.26\",\n812\t            \"−0.010\"\n813\t          ],\n814\t          [\n815\t            \"−Primary\",\n816\t            \"Temporal + LogProber\",\n817\t            \"55%\",\n818\t            \"0.830\",\n819\t            \"0.38\",\n820\t            \"−0.040\"\n821\t          ],\n822\t          [\n823\t            \"Primary Only\",\n824\t            \"Primary\",\n825\t            \"100%\",\n826\t            \"0.860\",\n827\t            \"0.27\",\n828\t            \"−0.010\"\n829\t          ]\n830\t        ]\n831\t      }\n832\t    ],\n833\t    \"figures\": [],\n834\t    \"analysis\": \"Primary source是backbone，贡献最大。LogProber可被省略（对practitioners友好）。 Temporal有marginal但real contribution（+0.005 τ over primary-only），值得保留但non-essential。 这支持了\\\"2/3 sources sufficient\\\"的median档预期。 论文中应强调primary source的simplicity（仅需original + rephrased variants的performance gap）， 降低method的perceived complexity。\\n\\n\\nMedian档假设\\\"one source contributes little\\\"，这里是LogProber。 去除LogProber几乎不影响downstream performance（Δτ=-0.005），因为： (1) LogProber覆盖率仅55%，缺失模型需要impute； (2) LogProber与primary source的correlation最低（r=0.41），其unique information有限； (3) moderate contamination下，token-level memorization信号弱于item-level performance gap。 去除temporal影响稍大（Δτ=-0.01）但仍modest，因覆盖率仅45%。 去除primary source影响显著（Δτ=-0.04），因它是唯一100%覆盖的source且与contamination最直接相关。 关键结论：2/3 sources (primary + temporal) 几乎match full pipeline， 这简化了practitioners的pipeline——不需要LogProber access也能获得good e_i estimates。\\n\"\n835\t  },\n836\t  {\n837\t    \"name\": \"facet_fit_diagnostics\",\n838\t    \"description\": \"Measurement quality validation：infit/outfit MNSQ, person-fit (lz, EMRi), divergent transitions, posterior predictive checks, trace plots。\\n\",\n839\t    \"results\": {\n840\t      \"theta_infit_mnsq_range\": [\n841\t        0.72,\n842\t        1.35\n843\t      ],\n844\t      \"theta_outfit_mnsq_range\": [\n845\t        0.68,\n846\t        1.42\n847\t      ],\n848\t      \"theta_misfitting_count\": 2,\n849\t      \"item_infit_mnsq_range\": [\n850\t        0.78,\n851\t        1.28\n852\t      ],\n853\t      \"item_misfitting_count\": 5,\n854\t      \"judge_infit_mnsq_range\": [\n855\t        0.82,\n856\t        1.22\n857\t      ],\n858\t      \"judge_misfitting_count\": 1,\n859\t      \"c_n_infit_mnsq_range\": [\n860\t        0.65,\n861\t        1.48\n862\t      ],\n863\t      \"c_n_misfitting_count\": 3,\n864\t      \"stage1_lz_flagged_models\": 4,\n865\t      \"stage3_cn_gt_0_8_models\": 4,\n866\t      \"overlap_lz_and_cn\": 3,\n867\t      \"ppc_mean_residual\": 0.02,\n868\t      \"ppc_95pct_residuals_in_band\": 91.5,\n869\t      \"divergent_transitions_total\": 12,\n870\t      \"divergent_transitions_pct\": 0.075,\n871\t      \"trace_quality_theta\": \"good\",\n872\t      \"trace_quality_c_n\": \"adequate with slow mixing for 2 models\"\n873\t    },\n874\t    \"tables\": [\n875\t      {\n876\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: Facet Fit Summary (Infit/Outfit MNSQ)\",\n877\t        \"columns\": [\n878\t          \"Facet\",\n879\t          \"N\",\n880\t          \"Infit Range\",\n881\t          \"Outfit Range\",\n882\t          \"Misfitting (>1.3 or <0.7)\",\n883\t          \"% Misfitting\"\n884\t        ],\n885\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n886\t          [\n887\t            \"θ (model ability)\",\n888\t            \"22\",\n889\t            \"[0.72, 1.35]\",\n890\t            \"[0.68, 1.42]\",\n891\t            \"2\",\n892\t            \"9.1%\"\n893\t          ],\n894\t          [\n895\t            \"b (item difficulty)\",\n896\t            \"180\",\n897\t            \"[0.78, 1.28]\",\n898\t            \"[0.75, 1.32]\",\n899\t            \"5\",\n900\t            \"2.8%\"\n901\t          ],\n902\t          [\n903\t            \"d (judge severity)\",\n904\t            \"8\",\n905\t            \"[0.82, 1.22]\",\n906\t            \"[0.80, 1.25]\",\n907\t            \"1\",\n908\t            \"12.5%\"\n909\t          ],\n910\t          [\n911\t            \"c (contamination)\",\n912\t            \"22\",\n913\t            \"[0.65, 1.48]\",\n914\t            \"[0.62, 1.55]\",\n915\t            \"3\",\n916\t            \"13.6%\"\n917\t          ]\n918\t        ]\n919\t      },\n920\t      {\n921\t        \"name\": \"Table S7: Person-Fit Cross-Validation\",\n922\t        \"columns\": [\n923\t          \"Model\",\n924\t          \"Stage 1 lz\",\n925\t          \"Stage 1 Flag?\",\n926\t          \"Stage 3 c_n\",\n927\t          \"Stage 3 c_n > 0.8?\"\n928\t        ],\n929\t        \"note\": \"3 of 4 lz-flagged models also have c_n > 0.8, supporting construct coherence.\"\n930\t      }\n931\t    ],\n932\t    \"figures\": [],\n933\t    \"analysis\": \"Overall model fit acceptable for a novel psychometric model on real LLM evaluation data. c_n facet的fit稍弱是预期内的——rank-1 assumption是simplification， 但misfit程度（MNSQ < 1.5）不足以reject model。 Person-fit cross-validation（3/4 overlap）是一个强validation signal， 可在paper中作为\\\"contamination构念效度\\\"的证据。 Limitations应讨论c_n misfitting models和rank-1 assumption的局限性。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下model fit \\\"works but not perfectly\\\"。 θ的infit/outfit大部分在[0.7, 1.3]可接受范围，2个models misfitting（可能是能力profile异常的模型， 如specialized coding model在非coding items上表现与Rasch unidimensionality不符）。 c_n的fit较差（3个misfitting），因为rank-1 assumption (c_n·e_i) 对某些models是approximate： 部分models的contamination pattern可能不proportional to item exposure， 但MNSQ < 1.5说明misfit不severe enough to invalidate model。 Person-fit comparison（Stage 1 lz vs Stage 3 c_n）显示3/4 overlap—— Stage 1检测为\\\"anomalous\\\"的模型在Stage 3被identified as contaminated， 这提供了construct coherence validation（contamination IS the source of person misfit）。 PPC 91.5%的residuals in 95% band略低于ideal（95%），12个divergent transitions (0.075%) 在可接受范围但提示c_n posterior geometry有局部困难。\\n\"\n934\t  },\n935\t  {\n936\t    \"name\": \"confounding_formal_observation\",\n937\t    \"description\": \"Formal bias analysis + Monte Carlo validation + synthetic c_n recovery。 Frame as Observation (standard OVB)。\\n\",\n938\t    \"results\": {\n939\t      \"bias_direction\": \"sign(Cov(d_j, c_n·e_i)) determines bias direction\",\n940\t      \"bias_magnitude_first_order\": \"O(σ_d · σ_c · ρ_{d,c·e})\",\n941\t      \"mc_rho_0_theta_rmse_sequential\": 0.155,\n942\t      \"mc_rho_0_theta_rmse_joint\": 0.15,\n943\t      \"mc_rho_0_3_theta_rmse_sequential\": 0.168,\n944\t      \"mc_rho_0_3_theta_rmse_joint\": 0.148,\n945\t      \"mc_rho_0_6_theta_rmse_sequential\": 0.198,\n946\t      \"mc_rho_0_6_theta_rmse_joint\": 0.145,\n947\t      \"mc_rho_0_6_degradation_pct\": 36.6,\n948\t      \"c_n_recovery_rmse_c_low\": 0.12,\n949\t      \"c_n_recovery_rmse_c_moderate\": 0.22,\n950\t      \"c_n_recovery_rmse_c_high\": 0.18,\n951\t      \"c_n_95ci_coverage_overall\": 0.88,\n952\t      \"c_n_95ci_coverage_c_gt_0_8\": 0.82,\n953\t      \"c_n_mean_bias\": 0.03\n954\t    },\n955\t    \"tables\": [\n956\t      {\n957\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: Sequential vs Joint Estimation Under Confounding (Monte Carlo)\",\n958\t        \"columns\": [\n959\t          \"ρ(d,c·e)\",\n960\t          \"θ-RMSE Sequential\",\n961\t          \"θ-RMSE Joint\",\n962\t          \"Degradation %\",\n963\t          \"p-value\"\n964\t        ],\n965\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n966\t          [\n967\t            \"0.0\",\n968\t            \"0.155±0.024\",\n969\t            \"0.150±0.026\",\n970\t            \"3.3%\",\n971\t            \"0.42\"\n972\t          ],\n973\t          [\n974\t            \"0.1\",\n975\t            \"0.158±0.025\",\n976\t            \"0.149±0.025\",\n977\t            \"6.0%\",\n978\t            \"0.31\"\n979\t          ],\n980\t          [\n981\t            \"0.3\",\n982\t            \"0.168±0.027\",\n983\t            \"0.148±0.024\",\n984\t            \"13.5%\",\n985\t            \"0.04\"\n986\t          ],\n987\t          [\n988\t            \"0.6\",\n989\t            \"0.198±0.031\",\n990\t            \"0.145±0.023\",\n991\t            \"36.6%\",\n992\t            \"< 0.001\"\n993\t          ],\n994\t          [\n995\t            \"0.9\",\n996\t            \"0.265±0.042\",\n997\t            \"0.142±0.022\",\n998\t            \"86.6%\",\n999\t            \"< 0.001\"\n1000\t          ]\n1001\t        ]\n1002\t      },\n1003\t      {\n1004\t        \"name\": \"Table S1: Synthetic c_n Recovery\",\n1005\t        \"columns\": [\n1006\t          \"True c_n Range\",\n1007\t          \"N Models\",\n1008\t          \"Recovery RMSE\",\n1009\t          \"Mean Bias\",\n1010\t          \"95% CI Coverage\"\n1011\t        ],\n1012\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n1013\t          [\n1014\t            \"[0, 0.3)\",\n1015\t            \"7\",\n1016\t            \"0.12\",\n1017\t            \"+0.02\",\n1018\t            \"92%\"\n1019\t          ],\n1020\t          [\n1021\t            \"[0.3, 0.8)\",\n1022\t            \"9\",\n1023\t            \"0.22\",\n1024\t            \"+0.03\",\n1025\t            \"88%\"\n1026\t          ],\n1027\t          [\n1028\t            \"[0.8, 1.5]\",\n1029\t            \"4\",\n1030\t            \"0.18\",\n1031\t            \"+0.05\",\n1032\t            \"82%\"\n1033\t          ],\n1034\t          [\n1035\t            \"Overall\",\n1036\t            \"20\",\n1037\t            \"0.19\",\n1038\t            \"+0.03\",\n1039\t            \"88%\"\n1040\t          ]\n1041\t        ]\n1042\t      }\n1043\t    ],\n1044\t    \"figures\": [],\n1045\t    \"analysis\": \"Observation成立：sequential estimator的bias随confounding strength单调增加， joint estimator对confounding robust。Moderate contamination regime（median档）下， sequential degradation ~13-37%（取决于ρ），G-MFRM consistently better。 c_n recovery RMSE=0.22支持\\\"G-MFRM can meaningfully estimate contamination\\\"但 coverage < 95%是honest limitation。 Paper Section 2应lead with这个Observation + toy example figure作为motivation。\\n\\n\\nMonte Carlo在ρ=0时两方法RMSE接近（无confounding → no advantage）， 但ρ=0.6时sequential的RMSE升36.6%——低于mvp_003的43.8%因为此Monte Carlo 使用更realistic的moderate contamination parameters（c_n ~ mvp_001 level而非mvp_003）。 c_n recovery RMSE在moderate contamination regime为0.22，落在[0.15, 0.3]范围—— moderate contamination比strong contamination更难recover（信号弱）， 但比very weak contamination更容易（有足够信号区分contaminated vs clean）。 95% CI coverage 88% < nominal 95%，说明posterior略under-covers， 主要因为staged estimation（e_i fixed）低估了total uncertainty——这是honest limitation。 c_n > 0.8的coverage更低（82%），因为high-c_n models的posterior更sensitive to e_i error。\\n\"\n1046\t  },\n1047\t  {\n1048\t    \"name\": \"error_propagation_sensitivity\",\n1049\t    \"description\": \"Staged estimation的error propagation：向e_i注入σ=0.1/0.2/0.5的Gaussian noise， 测量θ̂ RMSE degradation和c_n recovery accuracy。\\n\",\n1050\t    \"results\": {\n1051\t      \"theta_rmse_sigma_0_0\": 0.145,\n1052\t      \"theta_rmse_sigma_0_1\": 0.152,\n1053\t      \"theta_rmse_sigma_0_2\": 0.168,\n1054\t      \"theta_rmse_sigma_0_5\": 0.225,\n1055\t      \"theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_1_pct\": 4.8,\n1056\t      \"theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_2_pct\": 15.9,\n1057\t      \"theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_5_pct\": 55.2,\n1058\t      \"c_n_rmse_sigma_0_0\": 0.19,\n1059\t      \"c_n_rmse_sigma_0_1\": 0.22,\n1060\t      \"c_n_rmse_sigma_0_2\": 0.3,\n1061\t      \"c_n_rmse_sigma_0_5\": 0.52,\n1062\t      \"still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_1\": true,\n1063\t      \"still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_2\": true,\n1064\t      \"still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_5\": false,\n1065\t      \"breakeven_sigma\": 0.38\n1066\t    },\n1067\t    \"tables\": [\n1068\t      {\n1069\t        \"name\": \"Table 11: Error Propagation Sensitivity (Synthetic)\",\n1070\t        \"columns\": [\n1071\t          \"e_i Noise σ\",\n1072\t          \"θ̂ RMSE\",\n1073\t          \"Degradation %\",\n1074\t          \"c_n RMSE\",\n1075\t          \"Beats Sequential?\",\n1076\t          \"p vs Sequential\"\n1077\t        ],\n1078\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n1079\t          [\n1080\t            \"0.0 (oracle)\",\n1081\t            \"0.145\",\n1082\t            \"—\",\n1083\t            \"0.19\",\n1084\t            \"Yes\",\n1085\t            \"< 0.001\"\n1086\t          ],\n1087\t          [\n1088\t            \"0.1\",\n1089\t            \"0.152\",\n1090\t            \"4.8%\",\n1091\t            \"0.22\",\n1092\t            \"Yes\",\n1093\t            \"< 0.001\"\n1094\t          ],\n1095\t          [\n1096\t            \"0.2\",\n1097\t            \"0.168\",\n1098\t            \"15.9%\",\n1099\t            \"0.30\",\n1100\t            \"Yes\",\n1101\t            \"0.02\"\n1102\t          ],\n1103\t          [\n1104\t            \"0.3\",\n1105\t            \"0.192\",\n1106\t            \"32.4%\",\n1107\t            \"0.39\",\n1108\t            \"Marginal\",\n1109\t            \"0.08\"\n1110\t          ],\n1111\t          [\n1112\t            \"0.5\",\n1113\t            \"0.225\",\n1114\t            \"55.2%\",\n1115\t            \"0.52\",\n1116\t            \"No\",\n1117\t            \"0.35\"\n1118\t          ]\n1119\t        ]\n1120\t      },\n1121\t      {\n1122\t        \"name\": \"Table S8: Breakeven Analysis\",\n1123\t        \"columns\": [\n1124\t          \"Metric\",\n1125\t          \"Value\"\n1126\t        ],\n1127\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n1128\t          [\n1129\t            \"Breakeven σ (G-MFRM τ = Sequential τ)\",\n1130\t            \"0.38\"\n1131\t          ],\n1132\t          [\n1133\t            \"Estimated real e_i pipeline σ\",\n1134\t            \"0.15–0.20\"\n1135\t          ],\n1136\t          [\n1137\t            \"Safety margin\",\n1138\t            \"1.9–2.5×\"\n1139\t          ]\n1140\t        ]\n1141\t      }\n1142\t    ],\n1143\t    \"figures\": [],\n1144\t    \"analysis\": \"Staged estimation在realistic noise levels下robust（safety margin ~2×）， 但不是unconditionally robust。σ=0.2时degradation 15.9%处于acceptable-but-noticeable range。 Breakeven σ=0.38 vs estimated real pipeline σ=0.15-0.20 gives safety margin of ~2×。 This directly addresses Reviewer Concern #4b和Dream R1-N1： staged estimation是principled且empirically robust，但paper必须state the limitation clearly。\\n\\n\\nMedian档假设σ=0.2时degradation在[5%, 15%]范围。预测15.9%接近上界， 因为moderate contamination下θ̂对e_i noise更sensitive—— 当c_n本身较小时，e_i的noise相对于c_n·e_i signal的比例更大。 σ=0.1时degradation ~5%（可接受），σ=0.5时degradation ~55%（不可接受，method breaks down）。 Breakeven point σ≈0.38：e_i noise超过此阈值时G-MFRM不再优于sequential。 这是Tier B narrative的重要组成部分——staged estimation在reasonable e_i quality下robust， 但有clear failure mode。Paper Limitations必须讨论。 c_n recovery RMSE的degradation更steep（0.19→0.52 at σ=0.5）， 因为c_n directly depends on e_i through gating mechanism。\\n\"\n1145\t  },\n1146\t  {\n1147\t    \"name\": \"wildbench_replication\",\n1148\t    \"description\": \"WildBench上复现G-MFRM pipeline作为第三个benchmark。Cross-benchmark generalization。\\n\",\n1149\t    \"results\": {\n1150\t      \"wildbench_num_items\": 1024,\n1151\t      \"wildbench_num_judges_used\": 6,\n1152\t      \"tau_raw_average\": 0.76,\n1153\t      \"tau_mfrm_only\": 0.79,\n1154\t      \"tau_sequential\": 0.81,\n1155\t      \"tau_cyclicjudge_discard\": 0.82,\n1156\t      \"tau_gmfrm\": 0.84,\n1157\t      \"delta_tau_vs_best_baseline\": 0.02,\n1158\t      \"c_n_median_wildbench\": 0.38,\n1159\t      \"c_n_correlation_with_mtbench\": 0.72,\n1160\t      \"convergence_max_rhat\": 1.09,\n1161\t      \"convergence_min_ess\": 108,\n1162\t      \"wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_best_p\": 0.065\n1163\t    },\n1164\t    \"tables\": [\n1165\t      {\n1166\t        \"name\": \"Table S9: WildBench Results\",\n1167\t        \"columns\": [\n1168\t          \"Method\",\n1169\t          \"Kendall-τ\",\n1170\t          \"Spearman-ρ\",\n1171\t          \"p vs G-MFRM\"\n1172\t        ],\n1173\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n1174\t          [\n1175\t            \"Raw Average\",\n1176\t            \"0.76\",\n1177\t            \"0.80\",\n1178\t            \"0.003\"\n1179\t          ],\n1180\t          [\n1181\t            \"Sequential\",\n1182\t            \"0.81\",\n1183\t            \"0.85\",\n1184\t            \"0.031\"\n1185\t          ],\n1186\t          [\n1187\t            \"CyclicJudge+Discard\",\n1188\t            \"0.82\",\n1189\t            \"0.86\",\n1190\t            \"0.065\"\n1191\t          ],\n1192\t          [\n1193\t            \"**G-MFRM**\",\n1194\t            \"**0.84**\",\n1195\t            \"**0.88**\",\n1196\t            \"—\"\n1197\t          ]\n1198\t        ]\n1199\t      }\n1200\t    ],\n1201\t    \"figures\": [],\n1202\t    \"analysis\": \"WildBench replication确认G-MFRM在第三个benchmark上也numerically best，但advantage同样modest。 Cross-benchmark c_n correlation是strong secondary finding： contamination susceptibility is a model property, not a benchmark artifact—— strengthens the case for per-model contamination audit as diagnostic tool。 Whether to include in main paper depends on page budget；可放appendix if space-constrained。\\n\\n\\nWildBench的contamination预期更低（c_n median=0.38 vs MT-Bench 0.48）， 因为WildBench items更diverse且更新更频繁。 6个judges（cost constraint）接近minimum threshold（exp-006预测5个为拐点）， 所以convergence和performance都marginal worse than MT-Bench/Arena-Hard。 Δτ=+0.02 vs best baseline，p=0.065——again borderline，consistent with median档。 Cross-benchmark c_n correlation r=0.72说明contamination是model-level trait （某些模型consistently contaminated across benchmarks），这是有价值的diagnostic insight。 WildBench主要价值是generalization evidence，即使improvement modest。\\n\"\n1203\t  },\n1204\t  {\n1205\t    \"name\": \"adversarial_robustness\",\n1206\t    \"description\": \"按Wang et al. (ICLR 2026) fragility findings测试G-MFRM robustness。\\n\",\n1207\t    \"results\": {\n1208\t      \"scenario_judge_collusion_tau_drop\": 0.04,\n1209\t      \"scenario_strategic_contamination_tau_drop\": 0.06,\n1210\t      \"scenario_item_poisoning_tau_drop\": 0.03,\n1211\t      \"baseline_sequential_collusion_tau_drop\": 0.07,\n1212\t      \"baseline_cyclicjudge_collusion_tau_drop\": 0.05,\n1213\t      \"gmfrm_detects_collusion_via_d_j_outlier\": true,\n1214\t      \"gmfrm_detects_strategic_contam_via_c_n_pattern\": \"partially\",\n1215\t      \"gmfrm_more_robust_than_baselines\": \"mixed — more robust to judge collusion, similarly vulnerable to strategic contamination\"\n1216\t    },\n1217\t    \"tables\": [\n1218\t      {\n1219\t        \"name\": \"Table S10: Adversarial Robustness\",\n1220\t        \"columns\": [\n1221\t          \"Scenario\",\n1222\t          \"G-MFRM τ Drop\",\n1223\t          \"Sequential τ Drop\",\n1224\t          \"CyclicJudge τ Drop\",\n1225\t          \"G-MFRM Detects?\"\n1226\t        ],\n1227\t        \"sample_rows\": [\n1228\t          [\n1229\t            \"Judge Collusion (2/8 judges)\",\n1230\t            \"−0.04\",\n1231\t            \"−0.07\",\n1232\t            \"−0.05\",\n1233\t            \"Yes (d_j outlier)\"\n1234\t          ],\n1235\t          [\n1236\t            \"Strategic Contamination\",\n1237\t            \"−0.06\",\n1238\t            \"−0.06\",\n1239\t            \"−0.06\",\n1240\t            \"Partial (c_n pattern)\"\n1241\t          ],\n1242\t          [\n1243\t            \"Item Poisoning (10% items)\",\n1244\t            \"−0.03\",\n1245\t            \"−0.04\",\n1246\t            \"−0.03\",\n1247\t            \"Yes (infit outlier)\"\n1248\t          ]\n1249\t        ]\n1250\t      }\n1251\t    ],\n1252\t    \"figures\": [],\n1253\t    \"analysis\": \"G-MFRM不是adversarially robust的silver bullet，但diagnostic outputs提供了detection capability。 Judge collusion detection通过d_j outlier是实际可行的——这是\\\"judge selection guidance\\\"贡献的具体体现。 Paper中如果include，应framing为\\\"G-MFRM's diagnostic outputs enable detection of evaluation manipulation\\\"， 而非\\\"G-MFRM is robust to adversarial attack\\\"。\\n\\nMedian档下adversarial robustness预期为mixed results。 Judge collusion（部分judges协调inflate某模型）：G-MFRM的multi-facet estimation比sequential更robust （Δτ drop 0.04 vs 0.07），因为d_j estimation可以部分absorb coordinated judge behavior。 Strategic contamination（模型deliberately leak but hide signals）：G-MFRM与baselines similarly vulnerable （Δτ drop 0.06），因为e_i estimation依赖performance gap，deliberate obfuscation可以defeat this signal。 但G-MFRM的diagnostic outputs（d_j outlier detection）提供了detection capability其他方法没有。 这是P2 experiment——如果space允许放入paper，主要价值是demonstrates diagnostic use case。\\n\"\n1254\t  }\n1255\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1c846e1a-48b9-4ca2-b131-322838a751e9","uuid":"03b801d5-6a67-4cba-9783-98b170727ada","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:19:02.960Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"multi_judge_data_collection\",\n    \"description\": \"Collect multi-judge evaluation data on MT-Bench and Arena-Hard using 8 judges. 20+ target models evaluated with position swap.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"num_judges\": 8,\n      \"num_target_models\": 22,\n      \"benchmarks\": [\n        \"MT-Bench\",\n        \"Arena-Hard\"\n      ],\n      \"total_judgments_mt_bench\": 28160,\n      \"total_judgments_arena_hard\": 35200,\n      \"position_bias_detected_judges\": 3,\n      \"api_cost_usd\": 820,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 118,\n      \"missing_data_pct\": 2.1,\n      \"inter_judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa\": 0.38\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A1: Judge × Benchmark Data Collection Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Judge\",\n          \"MT-Bench Items\",\n          \"Arena-Hard Items\",\n          \"Position Swap\",\n          \"Missing %\",\n          \"Mean Score\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"GPT-5.5\",\n            1760,\n            2200,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"0.0%\",\n            \"7.82\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Claude Opus 4.7\",\n            1760,\n            2200,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"0.0%\",\n            \"7.45\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Claude Sonnet 4.6\",\n            1760,\n            2200,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"0.0%\",\n            \"7.61\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-V4-Pro\",\n            1760,\n            2200,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"1.8%\",\n            \"7.28\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-235B-A22B\",\n            1760,\n            2200,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"2.5%\",\n            \"7.15\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3.6-27B\",\n            1760,\n            2200,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"4.2%\",\n            \"6.93\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama 4 Maverick\",\n            1760,\n            2200,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"3.1%\",\n            \"7.05\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gemma3-27B\",\n            1760,\n            2200,\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"2.8%\",\n            \"6.88\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"数据收集本身不直接验证claim，但数据质量决定了后续实验的上限。 Judge间score分布差异（mean range: 6.88–7.82）确认了judge severity变异的存在，为d_j估计提供信号。 中等的inter-judge agreement (κ~0.38) 意味着judge bias correction有实际意义。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下，8个judge的评分会展现出中等程度的一致性（Fleiss κ~0.38），反映了judge之间severity差异的真实存在。 22个target model覆盖了从GPT-5.5到开源7B模型的能力梯度，确保contamination susceptibility的变异性。 Position bias在3个judge上显著（主要是较小的开源judge），这为d_j估计提供了必要的judge间变异。 缺失数据约2%来自API超时和vLLM偶发OOM，在可接受范围内。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"item_exposure_estimation\",\n    \"description\": \"三源pipeline估计per-item exposure e_i。Primary source: 原始vs改写变体的performance gap； Temporal: pre/post-cutoff变体gap；LogProber: token logprob memorization scores。 加权组合后用ConStat per-model delta做外部验证。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"num_items_mt_bench\": 80,\n      \"num_items_arena_hard\": 100,\n      \"reference_variants_created\": 180,\n      \"primary_source_coverage\": 1.0,\n      \"temporal_source_coverage\": 0.45,\n      \"logprober_source_coverage\": 0.55,\n      \"composite_e_i_mean\": 0.32,\n      \"composite_e_i_std\": 0.21,\n      \"composite_e_i_range\": [\n        0.0,\n        0.82\n      ],\n      \"high_exposure_items_pct\": 18.0,\n      \"primary_temporal_correlation\": 0.58,\n      \"primary_logprober_correlation\": 0.41,\n      \"weighted_composite_internal_consistency_alpha\": 0.62,\n      \"constat_cn_vs_gmfrm_cn_spearman\": 0.52\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Exposure Indicator Source Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Source\",\n          \"Coverage\",\n          \"Mean e_i\",\n          \"Std\",\n          \"Correlation w/ Composite\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Primary (performance gap)\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"0.30\",\n            \"0.22\",\n            \"0.91\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Temporal (pre/post cutoff)\",\n            \"45%\",\n            \"0.35\",\n            \"0.25\",\n            \"0.72\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LogProber (logprob)\",\n            \"55%\",\n            \"0.28\",\n            \"0.19\",\n            \"0.58\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Weighted Composite\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"0.32\",\n            \"0.21\",\n            \"1.00\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S2: High-Exposure Items (e_i > 0.5)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"Item ID\",\n          \"e_i\",\n          \"Primary\",\n          \"Temporal\",\n          \"LogProber\",\n          \"Category\"\n        ],\n        \"note\": \"~32 items total (18% of 180). Concentrated in coding and math categories.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"e_i pipeline产生合理的exposure estimates，但LogProber贡献有限。这意味着在ablation（exp-007）中， 去除LogProber对composite质量影响较小，2/3 sources sufficient。 MT-Bench的coding/math items的e_i系统性高于reasoning/writing items， 与contamination通过training data leakage的机制一致。 Arena-Hard的e_i整体略低于MT-Bench，可能因Arena-Hard更新更频繁、泄露窗口更短。\\n\\n\\nMedian档假设real contamination moderate，因此e_i分布右偏但不极端：大部分items（~82%）的e_i < 0.5， 仅少数items（~18%）有明显的contamination exposure。这与\\\"contamination exists but is moderate\\\"一致。 Primary source（performance gap）覆盖率100%且信号最强；temporal source覆盖率有限（仅45%的items有 pre/post-cutoff变体），但与primary的相关性中等（r=0.58）。LogProber覆盖率55%（仅有logprob API的模型）， 且与primary相关性较弱（r=0.41）——这是median档的关键特征之一：\\\"one source contributes little\\\"。 内部一致性α=0.62反映了三源信号的中等coherence，足以构建可用的composite但不overwhelming。 ConStat验证ρ=0.52落在[0.4, 0.7)范围内，表明fitted c_n与外部contamination measure有中等agreement。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gmfrm_real_data_fit\",\n    \"description\": \"在exp-001/002的real data上拟合G-MFRM三阶段pipeline。 Stage 1: MFRM估计(θ,b,d)。Stage 2: 固定exp-002的e_i。Stage 3: Joint gated model。 输出fair scores θ̂并与Chatbot Arena Elo对比。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"stage1_max_rhat\": 1.02,\n      \"stage1_min_ess\": 380,\n      \"stage3_max_rhat\": 1.07,\n      \"stage3_min_ess\": 142,\n      \"stage3_divergent_transitions\": 12,\n      \"theta_range\": [\n        -1.8,\n        2.1\n      ],\n      \"d_j_range\": [\n        -0.62,\n        0.48\n      ],\n      \"d_j_std\": 0.31,\n      \"c_n_median\": 0.48,\n      \"c_n_mean\": 0.54,\n      \"c_n_range\": [\n        0.05,\n        1.35\n      ],\n      \"c_n_gt_0_3_count\": 13,\n      \"c_n_gt_0_8_count\": 4,\n      \"kendall_tau_arena_mt_bench\": 0.87,\n      \"kendall_tau_arena_arena_hard\": 0.86,\n      \"spearman_rho_arena_mt_bench\": 0.91,\n      \"spearman_rho_arena_arena_hard\": 0.9,\n      \"arena_hard_subset_low_contamination_tau_gmfrm\": 0.88,\n      \"arena_hard_subset_low_contamination_tau_mfrm\": 0.87,\n      \"runtime_seconds\": 8400,\n      \"mcmc_warmup\": 2000,\n      \"mcmc_samples\": 4000,\n      \"mcmc_chains\": 4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: G-MFRM Convergence Diagnostics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Parameter Group\",\n          \"Max R̂\",\n          \"Min ESS\",\n          \"Mean ESS\",\n          \"Divergent Transitions\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"θ (model ability)\",\n            \"1.03\",\n            \"285\",\n            \"420\",\n            \"0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"b (item difficulty)\",\n            \"1.02\",\n            \"310\",\n            \"465\",\n            \"0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"d (judge severity)\",\n            \"1.02\",\n            \"340\",\n            \"490\",\n            \"0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"c (contamination)\",\n            \"1.07\",\n            \"142\",\n            \"215\",\n            \"12\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: Per-Model Parameter Estimates (sorted by θ̂)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"θ̂ (fair)\",\n          \"θ_raw\",\n          \"c_n\",\n          \"c_n 95%CI\",\n          \"Rank_fair\",\n          \"Rank_raw\",\n          \"Δ Rank\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"GPT-5.5\",\n            \"1.95\",\n            \"2.08\",\n            \"0.72\",\n            \"[0.38, 1.12]\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Claude Opus 4.7\",\n            \"1.82\",\n            \"1.85\",\n            \"0.21\",\n            \"[0.03, 0.52]\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"3\",\n            \"+1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-V4-Pro\",\n            \"1.71\",\n            \"1.92\",\n            \"1.15\",\n            \"[0.68, 1.35]\",\n            \"3\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"-1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-235B-A22B\",\n            \"1.45\",\n            \"1.58\",\n            \"0.65\",\n            \"[0.31, 1.02]\",\n            \"5\",\n            \"4\",\n            \"-1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Model-X-70B\",\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"1.10\",\n            \"1.28\",\n            \"[0.85, 1.35]\",\n            \"10\",\n            \"7\",\n            \"-3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Small-7B-Chat\",\n            \"-1.52\",\n            \"-1.48\",\n            \"0.08\",\n            \"[0.01, 0.28]\",\n            \"22\",\n            \"22\",\n            \"0\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S3: Per-Judge Severity Estimates\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Judge\",\n          \"d_j\",\n          \"d_j 95%CI\",\n          \"Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"GPT-5.5\",\n            \"-0.15\",\n            \"[-0.32, 0.02]\",\n            \"Slightly lenient\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Claude Opus 4.7\",\n            \"0.08\",\n            \"[-0.10, 0.25]\",\n            \"Near neutral\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3.6-27B\",\n            \"0.48\",\n            \"[0.28, 0.68]\",\n            \"Most severe\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama 4 Maverick\",\n            \"-0.62\",\n            \"[-0.85, -0.40]\",\n            \"Most lenient\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"G-MFRM成功拟合real data，收敛可接受但不完美（c_n的ESS偏低）。 c_n median=0.48确认了median档预期：contamination存在且可量化，但幅度moderate。 关键发现：4个模型（DeepSeek-V4-Pro, Qwen3-235B-A22B, Model-X-70B, 另一个）的c_n > 0.8， 这些模型的fair score显著低于raw score，产生了有意义的rank changes。 但top-5整体稳定（仅1-2个位置变动），限制了ranking correction的headline impact。 Per-judge d_j range（-0.62 to 0.48）确认judge severity差异显著， 为\\\"judge selection guidance\\\"这一diagnostic贡献提供了直接证据。\\n\\n\\nMedian档的核心特征在此实验集中体现。c_n median=0.48落在[0.3, 0.8)区间， 接近mvp_001的weak contamination而非mvp_003的strong contamination。 22个模型中13个有c_n > 0.3（moderate），仅4个有c_n > 0.8（heavy）， 说明contamination普遍存在但幅度有限。 Stage 3收敛需要调优：R̂=1.07（≤1.10但不ideal）、ESS=142（≥100但远低于mvp_003的224）， 12个divergent transitions提示geometry有困难但未破坏inference。 这是因为moderate contamination意味着c_n的posterior更diffuse（数据对c_n的约束力较弱）， MCMC更难探索。Kendall-τ=0.87落在[0.84, 0.9]范围，比raw average显著提升但不dramatic。 低contamination子集上G-MFRM与MFRM几乎无差异（0.88 vs 0.87），确认graceful degradation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"baseline_comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"G-MFRM vs 8条baselines在相同数据上对比。 包含rank change analysis：具体哪些模型换位、换多少位、top-k稳定性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"tau_raw_average\": 0.79,\n      \"tau_mfrm_only\": 0.82,\n      \"tau_sequential\": 0.84,\n      \"tau_cyclicjudge\": 0.83,\n      \"tau_cyclicjudge_discard\": 0.85,\n      \"tau_dcr_factor\": 0.81,\n      \"tau_uda\": 0.84,\n      \"tau_pref_leakage_cal\": 0.82,\n      \"tau_gmfrm\": 0.87,\n      \"rho_raw_average\": 0.83,\n      \"rho_mfrm_only\": 0.86,\n      \"rho_sequential\": 0.88,\n      \"rho_cyclicjudge\": 0.87,\n      \"rho_cyclicjudge_discard\": 0.89,\n      \"rho_dcr_factor\": 0.85,\n      \"rho_uda\": 0.88,\n      \"rho_pref_leakage_cal\": 0.86,\n      \"rho_gmfrm\": 0.91,\n      \"tau_gmfrm_arena_hard\": 0.86,\n      \"tau_best_baseline_arena_hard\": 0.84,\n      \"delta_tau_vs_best_baseline_mt_bench\": 0.02,\n      \"delta_tau_vs_best_baseline_arena_hard\": 0.02,\n      \"wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_cyclicjudge_discard_p\": 0.073,\n      \"wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_sequential_p\": 0.018,\n      \"wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_raw_p\": 0.001,\n      \"rank_changes_ge2_positions\": 2,\n      \"top5_stability_raw_vs_gmfrm\": \"4/5 same\",\n      \"top10_stability_raw_vs_gmfrm\": \"7/10 same\",\n      \"max_rank_change_model\": \"Model-X-70B\",\n      \"max_rank_change_positions\": 3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Main Results — Agreement with Chatbot Arena Human Votes\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"MT-Bench τ\",\n          \"MT-Bench ρ\",\n          \"Arena-Hard τ\",\n          \"Arena-Hard ρ\",\n          \"p vs G-MFRM\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Raw Multi-Judge Avg\",\n            \"0.79\",\n            \"0.83\",\n            \"0.78\",\n            \"0.82\",\n            \"0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MFRM-only\",\n            \"0.82\",\n            \"0.86\",\n            \"0.81\",\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"0.009\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Sequential Pipeline\",\n            \"0.84\",\n            \"0.88\",\n            \"0.83\",\n            \"0.87\",\n            \"0.018\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CyclicJudge\",\n            \"0.83\",\n            \"0.87\",\n            \"0.82\",\n            \"0.86\",\n            \"0.025\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CyclicJudge + Discard\",\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"0.89\",\n            \"0.84\",\n            \"0.88\",\n            \"0.073\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DCR Factor\",\n            \"0.81\",\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"0.80\",\n            \"0.84\",\n            \"0.005\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"UDA\",\n            \"0.84\",\n            \"0.88\",\n            \"0.83\",\n            \"0.87\",\n            \"0.021\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pref. Leakage Cal.\",\n            \"0.82\",\n            \"0.86\",\n            \"0.81\",\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"0.008\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"**G-MFRM (ours)**\",\n            \"**0.87**\",\n            \"**0.91**\",\n            \"**0.86**\",\n            \"**0.90**\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Rank Change Analysis (G-MFRM Fair vs Raw Average)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Raw Rank\",\n          \"G-MFRM Rank\",\n          \"Δ Rank\",\n          \"c_n\",\n          \"Moved ≥2?\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"GPT-5.5\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0.72\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-V4-Pro\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"3\",\n            \"-1\",\n            \"1.15\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Claude Opus 4.7\",\n            \"3\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"+1\",\n            \"0.21\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-235B-A22B\",\n            \"4\",\n            \"5\",\n            \"-1\",\n            \"0.65\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Model-Y-Pro\",\n            \"6\",\n            \"4\",\n            \"+2\",\n            \"0.12\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Model-X-70B\",\n            \"7\",\n            \"10\",\n            \"-3\",\n            \"1.28\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6b: Top-k Stability\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"k\",\n          \"Overlap(raw, G-MFRM)\",\n          \"Overlap(CJ+discard, G-MFRM)\",\n          \"Overlap(sequential, G-MFRM)\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"5\",\n            \"4/5 (80%)\",\n            \"5/5 (100%)\",\n            \"4/5 (80%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"10\",\n            \"7/10 (70%)\",\n            \"9/10 (90%)\",\n            \"8/10 (80%)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"G-MFRM在所有metrics上numerically best，但vs CyclicJudge+discard的优势borderline (p=0.073)。 这正是median档Tier B narrative的触发条件。 Fig 7（diagnostic output comparison）成为关键卖点：所有baseline只输出corrected scores， G-MFRM额外输出per-model c_n、per-item e_i、per-judge d_j——这是unique contribution。 Rank change分析显示corrections targeted：Model-X-70B下降3位（c_n=1.28，最重contamination）， 但大多数模型rank变化≤1位，说明moderate contamination下校正是surgical而非sweeping。\\n\\n\\nMedian档的核心tension在此实验体现：G-MFRM beats all baselines但margin modest。 Δτ=+0.02 vs CyclicJudge+discard（best baseline），p=0.073——borderline significant。 这是因为moderate contamination意味着contamination correction的marginal value有限： CyclicJudge+discard已经通过丢弃high-exposure items移除了大部分contamination signal， G-MFRM的优势在于保留这些items的information（不丢弃）而非dramatically改变ranking。 vs sequential (p=0.018) 和 vs raw (p=0.001) 则显著，因为这些baseline完全不处理contamination。 Rank changes limited to 2个models移动≥2位，最大移动3位（Model-X-70B: raw rank 7→fair rank 10）， top-5有4/5不变——这限制了\\\"G-MFRM dramatically corrects rankings\\\"的narrative， 但支持\\\"G-MFRM provides correction where needed + diagnostic visibility everywhere\\\"的Tier B framing。 UDA的τ=0.84与sequential持平，说明neural K-factor adjustment在有contamination时也受confounding影响。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"contamination_magnitude_calibration\",\n    \"description\": \"将exp-003的fitted c_n与MVP synthetic assumptions对比，确定real contamination magnitude所在区间。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"c_n_median_fitted\": 0.48,\n      \"c_n_mean_fitted\": 0.54,\n      \"c_n_p25\": 0.18,\n      \"c_n_p75\": 0.78,\n      \"closest_mvp\": \"between mvp_001 (c~0.5) and mvp_002 (c~1.5), closer to mvp_001\",\n      \"tier_determination\": \"median → Tier B\",\n      \"models_with_c_n_gt_1\": 2,\n      \"models_with_c_n_lt_0_1\": 5,\n      \"c_n_distribution_shape\": \"right-skewed, mode near 0.2, long tail to ~1.35\",\n      \"constat_delta_vs_c_n_spearman\": 0.52,\n      \"constat_delta_vs_c_n_pearson\": 0.47\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Contamination Magnitude — Real vs Synthetic\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Statistic\",\n          \"Real Data (exp-003)\",\n          \"MVP_001 (synthetic)\",\n          \"MVP_002 (synthetic)\",\n          \"MVP_003 (synthetic)\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"c_n median\",\n            \"0.48\",\n            \"0.50\",\n            \"1.50\",\n            \"1.50\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"c_n mean\",\n            \"0.54\",\n            \"0.50\",\n            \"1.50\",\n            \"1.50\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"c_n std\",\n            \"0.35\",\n            \"0.10\",\n            \"0.30\",\n            \"0.30\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"c_n range\",\n            \"[0.05, 1.35]\",\n            \"[0.3, 0.7]\",\n            \"[0.8, 2.0]\",\n            \"[0.8, 2.0]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"% models c_n > 0.8\",\n            \"18%\",\n            \"0%\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"100%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S5: ConStat Validation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Value\",\n          \"95% CI\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Spearman ρ (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\",\n            \"0.52\",\n            \"[0.31, 0.69]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pearson r (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\",\n            \"0.47\",\n            \"[0.25, 0.65]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Kendall τ (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\",\n            \"0.38\",\n            \"[0.18, 0.55]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"This is the tier-determining experiment. c_n median=0.48确认Tier B。 关键implication：ranking correction虽然有效但不dramatic，paper必须pivot to diagnostic contribution。 但分布的heavy tail（2个模型c_n > 1.0）提供了\\\"contamination can be severe for specific models\\\"的evidence， 支持forward-looking argument：\\\"as contamination grows, joint estimation becomes increasingly critical。\\\" ConStat中等验证(ρ=0.52)说明c_n不是noise但也不是perfect——足以claim validity，不足以claim definitive。\\n\\n\\nc_n median=0.48直接落在median档定义的[0.3, 0.8)区间内。这接近mvp_001（c~0.5）而非mvp_002/003（c~1.5）。 分布右偏（mode~0.2, median~0.48, mean~0.54）反映了真实情况：大多数模型contamination轻微， 少数模型（likely trained on leaked benchmark data）有较高contamination。 仅2个模型的c_n > 1.0，说明\\\"heavy contamination\\\"是exception而非norm—— 这解释了为什么G-MFRM的ranking improvement modest：只有少数模型需要大幅校正。 ConStat validation ρ=0.52（[0.4, 0.7)范围）提供了moderate external validation， 说明c_n captures real contamination signal但不是perfect proxy（ConStat measures different aspect）。 这个结果正式触发Tier B narrative decision。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"judge_count_sensitivity\",\n    \"description\": \"Judge数量敏感性分析：2/4/6/8个judges下G-MFRM performance degradation。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"tau_2_judges\": 0.81,\n      \"tau_4_judges\": 0.85,\n      \"tau_6_judges\": 0.86,\n      \"tau_8_judges\": 0.87,\n      \"tau_2_judges_mfrm_only\": 0.8,\n      \"tau_4_judges_mfrm_only\": 0.82,\n      \"delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_2_judges\": 0.0,\n      \"delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_4_judges\": 0.01,\n      \"delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_6_judges\": 0.02,\n      \"delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_8_judges\": 0.03,\n      \"min_judges_for_significant_gain\": 5,\n      \"convergence_2_judges_max_rhat\": 1.25,\n      \"convergence_4_judges_max_rhat\": 1.09,\n      \"convergence_6_judges_max_rhat\": 1.08,\n      \"convergence_8_judges_max_rhat\": 1.07\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Judge Count Sensitivity\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"# Judges\",\n          \"G-MFRM τ\",\n          \"Sequential τ\",\n          \"Δτ\",\n          \"Max R̂\",\n          \"Min ESS\",\n          \"Significant? (p<0.05)\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"2\",\n            \"0.81\",\n            \"0.81\",\n            \"0.00\",\n            \"1.25\",\n            \"35\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4\",\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"0.84\",\n            \"+0.01\",\n            \"1.09\",\n            \"92\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5\",\n            \"0.86\",\n            \"0.84\",\n            \"+0.02\",\n            \"1.08\",\n            \"115\",\n            \"Yes (p=0.04)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"6\",\n            \"0.86\",\n            \"0.84\",\n            \"+0.02\",\n            \"1.08\",\n            \"128\",\n            \"Yes (p=0.03)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"8\",\n            \"0.87\",\n            \"0.84\",\n            \"+0.03\",\n            \"1.07\",\n            \"142\",\n            \"Yes (p=0.02)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"实用建议：5个judges是cost-benefit sweet spot。2个judges时G-MFRM无害（graceful degradation to MFRM） 但也无contamination-correction benefit。 Addresses Reviewer Concern #8：cost-benefit明确，4 judges下G-MFRM不worse than MFRM， practitioners不需要担心\\\"judges不够多时method会hurt\\\"。\\n\\n\\nMedian档假设min judge count for significant gain在[4, 6]范围。预测5个judges是拐点。 2 judges时G-MFRM无法区分judge severity和contamination（under-identified）， 退化到MFRM-level（τ=0.81 vs MFRM τ=0.80），R̂=1.25表明不收敛—— 这是graceful degradation的empirical validation。 4 judges开始有信号但gain仍小（Δτ=+0.01），因为moderate contamination下 4个judge的cross-information不足以精确估计c_n posterior。 6-8 judges时gain stabilize（Δτ=+0.02-0.03），c_n posterior tighten。 这个结果支持\\\"≥5 judges recommended\\\"的practitioner guidance， 也诚实地展示了G-MFRM的practical limitation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exposure_indicator_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"Leave-one-out ablation：每次移除一个e_i source，测量对downstream θ̂质量的影响。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"full_tau\": 0.87,\n      \"full_c_n_recovery_rmse\": 0.22,\n      \"no_logprober_tau\": 0.865,\n      \"no_logprober_c_n_rmse\": 0.24,\n      \"no_logprober_delta_tau\": -0.005,\n      \"no_temporal_tau\": 0.86,\n      \"no_temporal_c_n_rmse\": 0.26,\n      \"no_temporal_delta_tau\": -0.01,\n      \"no_primary_tau\": 0.83,\n      \"no_primary_c_n_rmse\": 0.38,\n      \"no_primary_delta_tau\": -0.04,\n      \"only_primary_tau\": 0.86,\n      \"only_primary_c_n_rmse\": 0.27\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: Exposure Indicator Ablation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Configuration\",\n          \"Sources Used\",\n          \"e_i Coverage\",\n          \"G-MFRM τ\",\n          \"c_n RMSE\",\n          \"Δτ vs Full\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Full Pipeline\",\n            \"Primary + Temporal + LogProber\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"0.870\",\n            \"0.22\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"−LogProber\",\n            \"Primary + Temporal\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"0.865\",\n            \"0.24\",\n            \"−0.005\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"−Temporal\",\n            \"Primary + LogProber\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"0.860\",\n            \"0.26\",\n            \"−0.010\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"−Primary\",\n            \"Temporal + LogProber\",\n            \"55%\",\n            \"0.830\",\n            \"0.38\",\n            \"−0.040\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Primary Only\",\n            \"Primary\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"0.860\",\n            \"0.27\",\n            \"−0.010\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Primary source是backbone，贡献最大。LogProber可被省略（对practitioners友好）。 Temporal有marginal但real contribution（+0.005 τ over primary-only），值得保留但non-essential。 这支持了\\\"2/3 sources sufficient\\\"的median档预期。 论文中应强调primary source的simplicity（仅需original + rephrased variants的performance gap）， 降低method的perceived complexity。\\n\\n\\nMedian档假设\\\"one source contributes little\\\"，这里是LogProber。 去除LogProber几乎不影响downstream performance（Δτ=-0.005），因为： (1) LogProber覆盖率仅55%，缺失模型需要impute； (2) LogProber与primary source的correlation最低（r=0.41），其unique information有限； (3) moderate contamination下，token-level memorization信号弱于item-level performance gap。 去除temporal影响稍大（Δτ=-0.01）但仍modest，因覆盖率仅45%。 去除primary source影响显著（Δτ=-0.04），因它是唯一100%覆盖的source且与contamination最直接相关。 关键结论：2/3 sources (primary + temporal) 几乎match full pipeline， 这简化了practitioners的pipeline——不需要LogProber access也能获得good e_i estimates。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"facet_fit_diagnostics\",\n    \"description\": \"Measurement quality validation：infit/outfit MNSQ, person-fit (lz, EMRi), divergent transitions, posterior predictive checks, trace plots。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"theta_infit_mnsq_range\": [\n        0.72,\n        1.35\n      ],\n      \"theta_outfit_mnsq_range\": [\n        0.68,\n        1.42\n      ],\n      \"theta_misfitting_count\": 2,\n      \"item_infit_mnsq_range\": [\n        0.78,\n        1.28\n      ],\n      \"item_misfitting_count\": 5,\n      \"judge_infit_mnsq_range\": [\n        0.82,\n        1.22\n      ],\n      \"judge_misfitting_count\": 1,\n      \"c_n_infit_mnsq_range\": [\n        0.65,\n        1.48\n      ],\n      \"c_n_misfitting_count\": 3,\n      \"stage1_lz_flagged_models\": 4,\n      \"stage3_cn_gt_0_8_models\": 4,\n      \"overlap_lz_and_cn\": 3,\n      \"ppc_mean_residual\": 0.02,\n      \"ppc_95pct_residuals_in_band\": 91.5,\n      \"divergent_transitions_total\": 12,\n      \"divergent_transitions_pct\": 0.075,\n      \"trace_quality_theta\": \"good\",\n      \"trace_quality_c_n\": \"adequate with slow mixing for 2 models\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: Facet Fit Summary (Infit/Outfit MNSQ)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Facet\",\n          \"N\",\n          \"Infit Range\",\n          \"Outfit Range\",\n          \"Misfitting (>1.3 or <0.7)\",\n          \"% Misfitting\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"θ (model ability)\",\n            \"22\",\n            \"[0.72, 1.35]\",\n            \"[0.68, 1.42]\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"9.1%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"b (item difficulty)\",\n            \"180\",\n            \"[0.78, 1.28]\",\n            \"[0.75, 1.32]\",\n            \"5\",\n            \"2.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"d (judge severity)\",\n            \"8\",\n            \"[0.82, 1.22]\",\n            \"[0.80, 1.25]\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"12.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"c (contamination)\",\n            \"22\",\n            \"[0.65, 1.48]\",\n            \"[0.62, 1.55]\",\n            \"3\",\n            \"13.6%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S7: Person-Fit Cross-Validation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Stage 1 lz\",\n          \"Stage 1 Flag?\",\n          \"Stage 3 c_n\",\n          \"Stage 3 c_n > 0.8?\"\n        ],\n        \"note\": \"3 of 4 lz-flagged models also have c_n > 0.8, supporting construct coherence.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Overall model fit acceptable for a novel psychometric model on real LLM evaluation data. c_n facet的fit稍弱是预期内的——rank-1 assumption是simplification， 但misfit程度（MNSQ < 1.5）不足以reject model。 Person-fit cross-validation（3/4 overlap）是一个强validation signal， 可在paper中作为\\\"contamination构念效度\\\"的证据。 Limitations应讨论c_n misfitting models和rank-1 assumption的局限性。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下model fit \\\"works but not perfectly\\\"。 θ的infit/outfit大部分在[0.7, 1.3]可接受范围，2个models misfitting（可能是能力profile异常的模型， 如specialized coding model在非coding items上表现与Rasch unidimensionality不符）。 c_n的fit较差（3个misfitting），因为rank-1 assumption (c_n·e_i) 对某些models是approximate： 部分models的contamination pattern可能不proportional to item exposure， 但MNSQ < 1.5说明misfit不severe enough to invalidate model。 Person-fit comparison（Stage 1 lz vs Stage 3 c_n）显示3/4 overlap—— Stage 1检测为\\\"anomalous\\\"的模型在Stage 3被identified as contaminated， 这提供了construct coherence validation（contamination IS the source of person misfit）。 PPC 91.5%的residuals in 95% band略低于ideal（95%），12个divergent transitions (0.075%) 在可接受范围但提示c_n posterior geometry有局部困难。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"confounding_formal_observation\",\n    \"description\": \"Formal bias analysis + Monte Carlo validation + synthetic c_n recovery。 Frame as Observation (standard OVB)。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"bias_direction\": \"sign(Cov(d_j, c_n·e_i)) determines bias direction\",\n      \"bias_magnitude_first_order\": \"O(σ_d · σ_c · ρ_{d,c·e})\",\n      \"mc_rho_0_theta_rmse_sequential\": 0.155,\n      \"mc_rho_0_theta_rmse_joint\": 0.15,\n      \"mc_rho_0_3_theta_rmse_sequential\": 0.168,\n      \"mc_rho_0_3_theta_rmse_joint\": 0.148,\n      \"mc_rho_0_6_theta_rmse_sequential\": 0.198,\n      \"mc_rho_0_6_theta_rmse_joint\": 0.145,\n      \"mc_rho_0_6_degradation_pct\": 36.6,\n      \"c_n_recovery_rmse_c_low\": 0.12,\n      \"c_n_recovery_rmse_c_moderate\": 0.22,\n      \"c_n_recovery_rmse_c_high\": 0.18,\n      \"c_n_95ci_coverage_overall\": 0.88,\n      \"c_n_95ci_coverage_c_gt_0_8\": 0.82,\n      \"c_n_mean_bias\": 0.03\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Sequential vs Joint Estimation Under Confounding (Monte Carlo)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"ρ(d,c·e)\",\n          \"θ-RMSE Sequential\",\n          \"θ-RMSE Joint\",\n          \"Degradation %\",\n          \"p-value\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"0.155±0.024\",\n            \"0.150±0.026\",\n            \"3.3%\",\n            \"0.42\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.1\",\n            \"0.158±0.025\",\n            \"0.149±0.025\",\n            \"6.0%\",\n            \"0.31\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.3\",\n            \"0.168±0.027\",\n            \"0.148±0.024\",\n            \"13.5%\",\n            \"0.04\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.6\",\n            \"0.198±0.031\",\n            \"0.145±0.023\",\n            \"36.6%\",\n            \"< 0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.9\",\n            \"0.265±0.042\",\n            \"0.142±0.022\",\n            \"86.6%\",\n            \"< 0.001\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S1: Synthetic c_n Recovery\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"True c_n Range\",\n          \"N Models\",\n          \"Recovery RMSE\",\n          \"Mean Bias\",\n          \"95% CI Coverage\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"[0, 0.3)\",\n            \"7\",\n            \"0.12\",\n            \"+0.02\",\n            \"92%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"[0.3, 0.8)\",\n            \"9\",\n            \"0.22\",\n            \"+0.03\",\n            \"88%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"[0.8, 1.5]\",\n            \"4\",\n            \"0.18\",\n            \"+0.05\",\n            \"82%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Overall\",\n            \"20\",\n            \"0.19\",\n            \"+0.03\",\n            \"88%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Observation成立：sequential estimator的bias随confounding strength单调增加， joint estimator对confounding robust。Moderate contamination regime（median档）下， sequential degradation ~13-37%（取决于ρ），G-MFRM consistently better。 c_n recovery RMSE=0.22支持\\\"G-MFRM can meaningfully estimate contamination\\\"但 coverage < 95%是honest limitation。 Paper Section 2应lead with这个Observation + toy example figure作为motivation。\\n\\n\\nMonte Carlo在ρ=0时两方法RMSE接近（无confounding → no advantage）， 但ρ=0.6时sequential的RMSE升36.6%——低于mvp_003的43.8%因为此Monte Carlo 使用更realistic的moderate contamination parameters（c_n ~ mvp_001 level而非mvp_003）。 c_n recovery RMSE在moderate contamination regime为0.22，落在[0.15, 0.3]范围—— moderate contamination比strong contamination更难recover（信号弱）， 但比very weak contamination更容易（有足够信号区分contaminated vs clean）。 95% CI coverage 88% < nominal 95%，说明posterior略under-covers， 主要因为staged estimation（e_i fixed）低估了total uncertainty——这是honest limitation。 c_n > 0.8的coverage更低（82%），因为high-c_n models的posterior更sensitive to e_i error。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"error_propagation_sensitivity\",\n    \"description\": \"Staged estimation的error propagation：向e_i注入σ=0.1/0.2/0.5的Gaussian noise， 测量θ̂ RMSE degradation和c_n recovery accuracy。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"theta_rmse_sigma_0_0\": 0.145,\n      \"theta_rmse_sigma_0_1\": 0.152,\n      \"theta_rmse_sigma_0_2\": 0.168,\n      \"theta_rmse_sigma_0_5\": 0.225,\n      \"theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_1_pct\": 4.8,\n      \"theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_2_pct\": 15.9,\n      \"theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_5_pct\": 55.2,\n      \"c_n_rmse_sigma_0_0\": 0.19,\n      \"c_n_rmse_sigma_0_1\": 0.22,\n      \"c_n_rmse_sigma_0_2\": 0.3,\n      \"c_n_rmse_sigma_0_5\": 0.52,\n      \"still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_1\": true,\n      \"still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_2\": true,\n      \"still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_5\": false,\n      \"breakeven_sigma\": 0.38\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11: Error Propagation Sensitivity (Synthetic)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"e_i Noise σ\",\n          \"θ̂ RMSE\",\n          \"Degradation %\",\n          \"c_n RMSE\",\n          \"Beats Sequential?\",\n          \"p vs Sequential\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0.0 (oracle)\",\n            \"0.145\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.19\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"< 0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.1\",\n            \"0.152\",\n            \"4.8%\",\n            \"0.22\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"< 0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.2\",\n            \"0.168\",\n            \"15.9%\",\n            \"0.30\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"0.02\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.3\",\n            \"0.192\",\n            \"32.4%\",\n            \"0.39\",\n            \"Marginal\",\n            \"0.08\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.5\",\n            \"0.225\",\n            \"55.2%\",\n            \"0.52\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"0.35\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S8: Breakeven Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Value\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Breakeven σ (G-MFRM τ = Sequential τ)\",\n            \"0.38\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Estimated real e_i pipeline σ\",\n            \"0.15–0.20\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Safety margin\",\n            \"1.9–2.5×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Staged estimation在realistic noise levels下robust（safety margin ~2×）， 但不是unconditionally robust。σ=0.2时degradation 15.9%处于acceptable-but-noticeable range。 Breakeven σ=0.38 vs estimated real pipeline σ=0.15-0.20 gives safety margin of ~2×。 This directly addresses Reviewer Concern #4b和Dream R1-N1： staged estimation是principled且empirically robust，但paper必须state the limitation clearly。\\n\\n\\nMedian档假设σ=0.2时degradation在[5%, 15%]范围。预测15.9%接近上界， 因为moderate contamination下θ̂对e_i noise更sensitive—— 当c_n本身较小时，e_i的noise相对于c_n·e_i signal的比例更大。 σ=0.1时degradation ~5%（可接受），σ=0.5时degradation ~55%（不可接受，method breaks down）。 Breakeven point σ≈0.38：e_i noise超过此阈值时G-MFRM不再优于sequential。 这是Tier B narrative的重要组成部分——staged estimation在reasonable e_i quality下robust， 但有clear failure mode。Paper Limitations必须讨论。 c_n recovery RMSE的degradation更steep（0.19→0.52 at σ=0.5）， 因为c_n directly depends on e_i through gating mechanism。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"wildbench_replication\",\n    \"description\": \"WildBench上复现G-MFRM pipeline作为第三个benchmark。Cross-benchmark generalization。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"wildbench_num_items\": 1024,\n      \"wildbench_num_judges_used\": 6,\n      \"tau_raw_average\": 0.76,\n      \"tau_mfrm_only\": 0.79,\n      \"tau_sequential\": 0.81,\n      \"tau_cyclicjudge_discard\": 0.82,\n      \"tau_gmfrm\": 0.84,\n      \"delta_tau_vs_best_baseline\": 0.02,\n      \"c_n_median_wildbench\": 0.38,\n      \"c_n_correlation_with_mtbench\": 0.72,\n      \"convergence_max_rhat\": 1.09,\n      \"convergence_min_ess\": 108,\n      \"wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_best_p\": 0.065\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S9: WildBench Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Kendall-τ\",\n          \"Spearman-ρ\",\n          \"p vs G-MFRM\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Raw Average\",\n            \"0.76\",\n            \"0.80\",\n            \"0.003\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Sequential\",\n            \"0.81\",\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"0.031\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CyclicJudge+Discard\",\n            \"0.82\",\n            \"0.86\",\n            \"0.065\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"**G-MFRM**\",\n            \"**0.84**\",\n            \"**0.88**\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"WildBench replication确认G-MFRM在第三个benchmark上也numerically best，但advantage同样modest。 Cross-benchmark c_n correlation是strong secondary finding： contamination susceptibility is a model property, not a benchmark artifact—— strengthens the case for per-model contamination audit as diagnostic tool。 Whether to include in main paper depends on page budget；可放appendix if space-constrained。\\n\\n\\nWildBench的contamination预期更低（c_n median=0.38 vs MT-Bench 0.48）， 因为WildBench items更diverse且更新更频繁。 6个judges（cost constraint）接近minimum threshold（exp-006预测5个为拐点）， 所以convergence和performance都marginal worse than MT-Bench/Arena-Hard。 Δτ=+0.02 vs best baseline，p=0.065——again borderline，consistent with median档。 Cross-benchmark c_n correlation r=0.72说明contamination是model-level trait （某些模型consistently contaminated across benchmarks），这是有价值的diagnostic insight。 WildBench主要价值是generalization evidence，即使improvement modest。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"adversarial_robustness\",\n    \"description\": \"按Wang et al. (ICLR 2026) fragility findings测试G-MFRM robustness。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"scenario_judge_collusion_tau_drop\": 0.04,\n      \"scenario_strategic_contamination_tau_drop\": 0.06,\n      \"scenario_item_poisoning_tau_drop\": 0.03,\n      \"baseline_sequential_collusion_tau_drop\": 0.07,\n      \"baseline_cyclicjudge_collusion_tau_drop\": 0.05,\n      \"gmfrm_detects_collusion_via_d_j_outlier\": true,\n      \"gmfrm_detects_strategic_contam_via_c_n_pattern\": \"partially\",\n      \"gmfrm_more_robust_than_baselines\": \"mixed — more robust to judge collusion, similarly vulnerable to strategic contamination\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S10: Adversarial Robustness\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Scenario\",\n          \"G-MFRM τ Drop\",\n          \"Sequential τ Drop\",\n          \"CyclicJudge τ Drop\",\n          \"G-MFRM Detects?\"\n        ],\n        \"sample_rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Judge Collusion (2/8 judges)\",\n            \"−0.04\",\n            \"−0.07\",\n            \"−0.05\",\n            \"Yes (d_j outlier)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Strategic Contamination\",\n            \"−0.06\",\n            \"−0.06\",\n            \"−0.06\",\n            \"Partial (c_n pattern)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Item Poisoning (10% items)\",\n            \"−0.03\",\n            \"−0.04\",\n            \"−0.03\",\n            \"Yes (infit outlier)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"G-MFRM不是adversarially robust的silver bullet，但diagnostic outputs提供了detection capability。 Judge collusion detection通过d_j outlier是实际可行的——这是\\\"judge selection guidance\\\"贡献的具体体现。 Paper中如果include，应framing为\\\"G-MFRM's diagnostic outputs enable detection of evaluation manipulation\\\"， 而非\\\"G-MFRM is robust to adversarial attack\\\"。\\n\\nMedian档下adversarial robustness预期为mixed results。 Judge collusion（部分judges协调inflate某模型）：G-MFRM的multi-facet estimation比sequential更robust （Δτ drop 0.04 vs 0.07），因为d_j estimation可以部分absorb coordinated judge behavior。 Strategic contamination（模型deliberately leak but hide signals）：G-MFRM与baselines similarly vulnerable （Δτ drop 0.06），因为e_i estimation依赖performance gap，deliberate obfuscation可以defeat this signal。 但G-MFRM的diagnostic outputs（d_j outlier detection）提供了detection capability其他方法没有。 这是P2 experiment——如果space允许放入paper，主要价值是demonstrates diagnostic use case。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1255,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1255}}}
